window.JD_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"a lot – ahead","cards":[{"w":"a lot better","p":"adv.","d":"a lot · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好很多","s":"After a week of rest and hot soup, Grandpa feels a lot better and can take a walk in the park."},{"w":"Thanks a lot.","p":"adv.","d":"a lot · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多謝。","s":"Thanks a lot for helping me carry these heavy books to the library; I could not do it alone."},{"w":"a lot of fun","p":"adv.","d":"a lot · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很好玩","s":"We had a lot of fun at the beach last Sunday, and we swam, played ball, and ate ice cream together."},{"w":"talk a lot","p":"adv.","d":"a lot · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很愛講話","s":"My little sister talks a lot at dinner, so sometimes nobody else in the family can say a word."},{"w":"go abroad","p":"adv.","d":"abroad · A 延伸義／程度","c":"出國","s":"My uncle wants to go abroad next year to see Paris, so he is saving money and learning some French."},{"w":"study abroad","p":"adv.","d":"abroad · A 延伸義／程度","c":"留學","s":"Lisa hopes to study abroad in America after she finishes high school, so she practices English every day."},{"w":"travel abroad","p":"adv.","d":"abroad · A 延伸義／程度","c":"出國旅行","s":"My family will travel abroad for the first time this summer, and we are all excited about the trip to Japan."},{"w":"live abroad","p":"adv.","d":"abroad · A 延伸義／程度","c":"住在國外","s":"My aunt has lived abroad for ten years, but she still comes home to Taiwan every Chinese New Year."},{"w":"from abroad","p":"adv.","d":"abroad · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從國外來的","s":"These sweet apples come from abroad, so they cost more than the ones from the farms in Taiwan."},{"w":"go abroad（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"abroad · P 易混淆","c":"abroad 前不加介係詞","s":"Many people like to go abroad during the summer vacation, and the airport is always very crowded then."},{"w":"Actually, I don't know.","p":"adv.","d":"actually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"其實我不知道。","s":"Actually, I don't know where the new shopping center is, but we can look at the map on your phone."},{"w":"It actually works!","p":"adv.","d":"actually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"它居然有用！","s":"I pushed the old button on the radio that did not work just for fun, and it actually works again now!"},{"w":"What actually happened?","p":"adv.","d":"actually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到底發生什麼事？","s":"Nobody in class is talking about the fight, so can you tell me what actually happened during lunch break today?"},{"w":"Actually, yes.","p":"adv.","d":"actually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"其實，是的。","s":"When my teacher asked whether I had finished all the homework, I smiled and said, actually, yes, I did."},{"w":"again and again","p":"adv.","d":"again · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一再地","s":"The baby dropped the spoon again and again, and her mother picked it up every time with a smile."},{"w":"once again","p":"adv.","d":"again · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再一次","s":"Once again our team lost the basketball game by only two points, but the coach said we played well."},{"w":"now and again","p":"adv.","d":"again · A 延伸義／程度","c":"偶爾","s":"Now and again my grandfather tells us funny stories about his childhood in a small village near the sea."},{"w":"never again","p":"adv.","d":"again · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再也不要","s":"After eating ten hot dogs at the night market, Tom felt so sick that he said never again."},{"w":"Say it again, please.","p":"adv.","d":"again · A 延伸義／程度","c":"請再說一次。","s":"The new word is hard for me to hear clearly, so could you say it again, please, a little slower?"},{"w":"all over again","p":"adv.","d":"again · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從頭再來一次","s":"The computer stopped working before I saved my report, so I have to type it all over again tonight."},{"w":"a long time ago","p":"adv.","d":"ago · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很久以前","s":"A long time ago, people in this town did not have cars, and they walked or rode horses everywhere."},{"w":"ten years ago","p":"adv.","d":"ago · A 延伸義／程度","c":"十年前","s":"Ten years ago my parents opened this small noodle shop, and now many people in the city know it."},{"w":"not long ago","p":"adv.","d":"ago · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不久前","s":"Not long ago there was a big park here, but now a tall building stands in the same place."},{"w":"a while ago","p":"adv.","d":"ago · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一會兒之前","s":"Your sister called a while ago and asked you to bring an umbrella because it may rain this afternoon."},{"w":"a moment ago","p":"adv.","d":"ago · A 延伸義／程度","c":"剛才","s":"The teacher was standing right here a moment ago, so she must be in the office next door now."},{"w":"ago + 過去簡單式","p":"adv.","d":"ago · P 易混淆","c":"ago 只與過去式連用","s":"We watched a great movie two days ago, and I still remember every funny part of the story."},{"w":"three days ago","p":"adv.","d":"ago · P 易混淆","c":"三天前","s":"Three days ago my brother bought a new bike, but he already fell off it twice on the wet road."},{"w":"go ahead","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"請便；開始吧","s":"If you want to use my computer to finish your report, go ahead, because I do not need it tonight."},{"w":"ahead of time","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"提前","s":"We arrived at the train station ahead of time, so we had twenty minutes to buy some drinks and snacks."},{"w":"look ahead","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"向前看；展望未來","s":"Grandpa always tells us to look ahead and not to worry too much about the mistakes we made in the past."},{"w":"get ahead","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"領先；出人頭地","s":"If you want to get ahead in your job, you have to work hard and keep learning new things every day."},{"w":"straight ahead","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一直往前","s":"Walk straight ahead for about five minutes, and you will see the post office on your left side."},{"w":"the road ahead","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"前方的路","s":"The road ahead was dark and wet after the heavy rain, so Dad drove slowly and turned on the lights."},{"w":"be ahead of the class","p":"adv.","d":"ahead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在班上領先","s":"Mary reads a lot of English books at home, so she is always ahead of the class in reading tests."}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"all – alone","cards":[{"w":"all day long","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"整天","s":"It rained all day long on Saturday, so we stayed home and watched three movies with hot chocolate."},{"w":"all over the world","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"全世界","s":"Bubble tea from Taiwan is now popular all over the world, and you can find it in many countries."},{"w":"all the time","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一直；總是","s":"My little brother plays video games all the time, so Mom took his phone away until the test is over."},{"w":"all of a sudden","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"突然","s":"We were having a picnic in the park when all of a sudden it started to rain very hard."},{"w":"all right","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好的；沒問題","s":"Are you all right after falling off your bike, or should we go to see the doctor right now?"},{"w":"not at all","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一點也不","s":"I was not at all surprised when Kevin won the race, because he runs every morning before school."},{"w":"all at once","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"突然；同時","s":"The lights went out all at once during the storm, and everyone in the restaurant stopped talking for a second."},{"w":"after all","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"畢竟","s":"I decided not to be angry with my sister about the broken cup; after all, she is only five years old."},{"w":"first of all","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"首先","s":"First of all, wash your hands with soap before you touch any food in the kitchen, and then help me cook."},{"w":"above all","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最重要的是","s":"A good student should be polite, work hard, and above all be honest with teachers and friends."},{"w":"all alone","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"獨自一人","s":"My grandfather lives all alone in an old house in the mountains, so we visit him every weekend."},{"w":"all in all","p":"adv.","d":"all · A 延伸義／程度","c":"總而言之","s":"The trip was long, the hotel was small, and the food was strange, but all in all we had a good time."},{"w":"almost every day","p":"adv.","d":"almost · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎每天","s":"Jenny runs in the park almost every day after school, so it is not surprising that she is so healthy."},{"w":"almost finished","p":"adv.","d":"almost · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快做完了","s":"I am almost finished with my science report, so I can watch the baseball game with you after dinner."},{"w":"almost no money","p":"adv.","d":"almost · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎沒錢","s":"Tom has almost no money left this month because he spent it all on a new pair of basketball shoes."},{"w":"almost never","p":"adv.","d":"almost · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎不曾","s":"My father almost never eats fast food, because he says it is bad for his heart and makes him fat."},{"w":"almost everyone","p":"adv.","d":"almost · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎每個人","s":"Almost everyone in our class joined the school trip to the zoo, and only two students stayed at home."},{"w":"almost there","p":"adv.","d":"almost · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快到了","s":"Do not stop now, because we are almost there, and you can see the top of the mountain already."},{"w":"almost（幾乎）","p":"adv.","d":"almost · P 易混淆","c":"almost 修飾形容詞或動詞","s":"The water in the pool was almost too cold to swim in, but we still jumped in and had fun."},{"w":"nearly（幾乎，同 almost）","p":"adv.","d":"almost · P 易混淆","c":"nearly 多用於數量","s":"There were nearly fifty people waiting in line, and the wait was almost an hour, so we went to another shop."},{"w":"almost all students","p":"adv.","d":"almost · P 易混淆","c":"幾乎全部學生","s":"Almost all students in Taiwan learn English from a young age, so they can read simple English signs easily."},{"w":"leave me alone","p":"adv.","d":"alone · A 延伸義／程度","c":"別管我","s":"When my brother is angry, he goes to his room and shouts, leave me alone, so we wait until he feels better."},{"w":"live alone","p":"adv.","d":"alone · A 延伸義／程度","c":"獨居","s":"My grandmother has lived alone since Grandpa passed away, but her neighbors visit her every afternoon for tea."},{"w":"let alone","p":"adv.","d":"alone · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更不用說","s":"My little sister cannot even boil an egg, let alone cook a whole dinner for the family."},{"w":"go alone","p":"adv.","d":"alone · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一個人去","s":"It is already dark outside, so you should not go alone to the night market; wait for your brother."},{"w":"work alone","p":"adv.","d":"alone · A 延伸義／程度","c":"獨自工作","s":"Some people like to work alone in a quiet room, but I think it is more fun to work with a team."},{"w":"alone（獨自；不帶情緒）","p":"adv.","d":"alone · P 易混淆","c":"alone 可當形容詞或副詞","s":"Jack was alone at home last night, but he did not feel sad because he had a good book to read."},{"w":"I live alone.","p":"adv.","d":"alone · P 易混淆","c":"我獨居。","s":"I live alone in a small apartment near the train station, and I cook simple dinners for myself every night."}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"aloud – always","cards":[{"w":"read aloud","p":"adv.","d":"aloud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"朗讀","s":"Our English teacher asks one student to read aloud the first page every morning before the lesson begins."},{"w":"think aloud","p":"adv.","d":"aloud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"邊想邊說","s":"When I do hard math problems, I like to think aloud, so my brother always knows what I am doing."},{"w":"laugh aloud","p":"adv.","d":"aloud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大聲笑出來","s":"The joke was so funny that Peter laughed aloud in the library, and everyone turned to look at him."},{"w":"say it aloud","p":"adv.","d":"aloud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大聲說出來","s":"If you want to remember the new word, say it aloud three times and then write it down in your notebook."},{"w":"aloud（出聲地）","p":"adv.","d":"aloud · P 易混淆","c":"aloud 指發出聲音","s":"Dad reads the newspaper aloud at breakfast, so the whole family hears the news while we eat our eggs."},{"w":"I've already eaten.","p":"adv.","d":"already · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我已經吃過了。","s":"Thank you, but I've already eaten a big lunch at school, so I do not want any more rice now."},{"w":"It's already ten.","p":"adv.","d":"already · A 延伸義／程度","c":"已經十點了。","s":"Hurry up and get dressed, because it's already ten and the movie starts at half past ten."},{"w":"already here","p":"adv.","d":"already · A 延伸義／程度","c":"已經到了","s":"When I arrived at the bus stop in the rain, my friends were already here, waiting under a big umbrella."},{"w":"already done","p":"adv.","d":"already · A 延伸義／程度","c":"已經做好了","s":"You do not need to wash the dishes tonight, because they are already done, and the kitchen is clean."},{"w":"already know","p":"adv.","d":"already · A 延伸義／程度","c":"早就知道","s":"I already know the answer to this question, because our teacher taught us the same thing last week."},{"w":"already（已經；肯定句）","p":"adv.","d":"already · P 易混淆","c":"already 用於肯定句","s":"My brother has already finished his homework, so he is playing basketball with his friends in the park now."},{"w":"I also like it.","p":"adv.","d":"also · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我也喜歡。","s":"My brother loves this new movie about space, and I also like it, so we are going to see it again."},{"w":"not only…but also","p":"adv.","d":"also · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不但…而且","s":"Our math teacher is not only kind but also very funny, so nobody falls asleep in his class."},{"w":"also known as","p":"adv.","d":"also · A 延伸義／程度","c":"又名","s":"Taipei 101, also known as the tallest building in Taiwan for many years, is a popular place for visitors from abroad."},{"w":"He is also a teacher.","p":"adv.","d":"also · A 延伸義／程度","c":"他也是老師。","s":"Mr. Lin is a famous cook in our town, and he is also a teacher at the night school on weekends."},{"w":"also（放動詞前）","p":"adv.","d":"also · P 易混淆","c":"also 置於一般動詞前","s":"Jenny also plays the piano very well, so she will join the music club with her good friend this year."},{"w":"altogether twenty people","p":"adv.","d":"altogether · A 延伸義／程度","c":"總共二十人","s":"There are altogether twenty people at the birthday party tonight, so we need a bigger cake and more chairs."},{"w":"not altogether true","p":"adv.","d":"altogether · A 延伸義／程度","c":"並非完全正確","s":"What Tom said about the new teacher is not altogether true, so do not believe everything you hear in class."},{"w":"stop altogether","p":"adv.","d":"altogether · A 延伸義／程度","c":"完全停止","s":"My father used to smoke every day, but he decided to stop altogether after the doctor talked to him last year."},{"w":"That's a different thing altogether.","p":"adv.","d":"altogether · A 延伸義／程度","c":"那完全是另一回事。","s":"Riding a bike in the park is easy, but riding one on a busy street is a different thing altogether."},{"w":"altogether（總共；完全）","p":"adv.","d":"altogether · P 易混淆","c":"altogether 一字","s":"We bought three shirts and two pairs of shoes at the night market, and we spent two thousand dollars altogether."},{"w":"It costs 500 dollars altogether.","p":"adv.","d":"altogether · P 易混淆","c":"總共五百元。","s":"The dinner for six people costs 500 dollars altogether, so each of us only needs to pay a little."},{"w":"as always","p":"adv.","d":"always · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一如往常","s":"As always, Grandma made a big pot of hot soup for the whole family when we visited her on Sunday."},{"w":"not always","p":"adv.","d":"always · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不一定；未必","s":"Expensive things are not always better, so you should compare the prices carefully before you buy anything."},{"w":"always late","p":"adv.","d":"always · A 延伸義／程度","c":"總是遲到","s":"Kevin is always late for the morning class, so the teacher asked him to set two alarm clocks tonight."},{"w":"You can always ask.","p":"adv.","d":"always · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你隨時可以問。","s":"If you do not understand the lesson, you can always ask me after class, and I will explain it again."},{"w":"for always","p":"adv.","d":"always · A 延伸義／程度","c":"永遠","s":"My grandfather and grandmother got married fifty years ago, and they promised to love each other for always on that day."},{"w":"always 放 be 動詞後","p":"adv.","d":"always · P 易混淆","c":"be 動詞 + always","s":"My mother is always busy on weekday mornings because she has to make breakfast and drive us to school."},{"w":"always 放一般動詞前","p":"adv.","d":"always · P 易混淆","c":"always + 一般動詞","s":"My brother always brushes his teeth before he goes to bed, so the dentist says his teeth look great."},{"w":"He is always late.","p":"adv.","d":"always · P 易混淆","c":"他總是遲到。","s":"He is always late for the school bus, so his mother has to drive him to school almost every morning."},{"w":"He always comes late.","p":"adv.","d":"always · P 易混淆","c":"他總是晚到。","s":"Jason always comes late to the English club, so he often misses the first fun game of the afternoon."}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"anymore – as (1)","cards":[{"w":"not…anymore","p":"adv.","d":"anymore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不再…","s":"The old movie theater near the park is not open anymore, so we have to take the MRT to see a movie."},{"w":"I don't live here anymore.","p":"adv.","d":"anymore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我不住這裡了。","s":"I don't live here anymore because my family moved to Taichung last summer for my father's new job."},{"w":"not a kid anymore","p":"adv.","d":"anymore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不再是小孩了","s":"You are not a kid anymore, so you should clean your room and wash your clothes by yourself."},{"w":"can't wait anymore","p":"adv.","d":"anymore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不能再等了","s":"The pizza smells so good that my little brother can't wait anymore, and he is already waiting at the table."},{"w":"not…anymore（不再）","p":"adv.","d":"anymore · P 易混淆","c":"anymore 用於否定句尾","s":"Mary used to play the piano every evening, but she does not practice anymore because of her busy school life."},{"w":"anywhere you like","p":"adv.","d":"anywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你喜歡的任何地方","s":"On your birthday, we can have dinner anywhere you like, so think about your favorite restaurant in town."},{"w":"not going anywhere","p":"adv.","d":"anywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"哪裡都不去","s":"It is raining hard outside, and I am not going anywhere today, so I will read a book on the sofa."},{"w":"anywhere else","p":"adv.","d":"anywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"其他任何地方","s":"Is there anywhere else we can buy a cheaper school bag, or is this store the only one near here?"},{"w":"can't find it anywhere","p":"adv.","d":"anywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到處找不到","s":"I have looked in my bag, under the bed, and on the desk, but I can't find my keys anywhere."},{"w":"anywhere in Taiwan","p":"adv.","d":"anywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"台灣任何地方","s":"You can find a small store open all night anywhere in Taiwan, even in little towns in the mountains."},{"w":"anywhere（否定、問句）","p":"adv.","d":"anywhere · P 易混淆","c":"anywhere 用於否定句與問句","s":"Did you go anywhere interesting during the winter vacation, or did you just stay at home and rest?"},{"w":"live apart","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"分開住","s":"My parents live apart now because my father works in Taipei and my mother takes care of Grandma in Tainan."},{"w":"fall apart","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"散掉；崩潰","s":"This old chair is so weak that it will fall apart if a heavy person sits on it, so be careful."},{"w":"take apart","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"拆開","s":"My brother likes to take apart old radios and clocks to see how they work, and then he puts them back together."},{"w":"tell A and B apart","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"分辨A與B","s":"The two sisters look so much alike that even their teacher cannot tell Amy and Annie apart in class."},{"w":"far apart","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相距很遠","s":"My good friend Amy and I live far apart now, but we still talk on the phone every Saturday night."},{"w":"two meters apart","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相距兩公尺","s":"The teacher asked us to stand two meters apart in the playground, so the line looked very long."},{"w":"apart from","p":"adv.","d":"apart · A 延伸義／程度","c":"除了…之外","s":"Apart from a little rain on the first day, the weather was perfect during our whole trip to Kenting."},{"w":"look around","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"四處看看","s":"When we got to the new shopping center, we decided to look around first before buying anything for Mom."},{"w":"turn around","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"轉身","s":"I heard someone call my name on the street, so I turned around and saw my old friend from the first grade."},{"w":"around the corner","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在轉角；即將到來","s":"Summer vacation is just around the corner, and all the students are already making plans for the beach."},{"w":"around the world","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"全世界","s":"People around the world enjoy watching the Olympic Games on TV, and they cheer for their own teams."},{"w":"around ten o'clock","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"十點左右","s":"The movie starts at around ten o'clock tonight, so let's have dinner first and then walk to the theater."},{"w":"show you around","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"帶你參觀","s":"When you come to Tainan this weekend, I will show you around the old streets and the famous night market."},{"w":"hang around","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"閒晃","s":"Some students like to hang around the park after school instead of going straight home to study for tests."},{"w":"all year around","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一年到頭","s":"In the south of Taiwan, the weather is warm all year around, so people can swim in the sea in December."},{"w":"the other way around","p":"adv.","d":"around · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相反地","s":"I thought my sister broke the window, but it was the other way around; she was the one who found the glass."},{"w":"as usual","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"照常","s":"As usual, my father got up at six, made coffee, and read the newspaper before anyone else woke up."},{"w":"as well","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"也","s":"My sister is good at singing, and she can dance as well, so she wants to join the school show."},{"w":"as well as","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"以及","s":"At the party, we ate pizza and fried chicken as well as a big chocolate cake that Grandma made."},{"w":"as soon as possible","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"盡快","s":"Please send me the photos from the school trip as soon as possible, because I want to show them to my parents."},{"w":"as a result","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"結果","s":"Jack did not study for the English test at all, and as a result he got the lowest score in the class."},{"w":"such as","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"例如","s":"My mother likes to cook simple dishes, such as fried rice, vegetable soup, and eggs with tomatoes."},{"w":"as for me","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"至於我","s":"My brother wants to go to the mountains this weekend, but as for me, I would rather stay home and sleep."},{"w":"as if","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好像","s":"The little boy talks about dinosaurs as if he had seen them with his own eyes in a real forest."},{"w":"as long as","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"只要","s":"Mom said we can keep the little dog as long as we walk him every day and clean up after him."},{"w":"as far as I know","p":"adv.","d":"as · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就我所知","s":"As far as I know, the new library opens at nine in the morning, but you can call them to be sure."},{"w":"as…as","p":"adv.","d":"as · C 句型","c":"和…一樣","s":"My little brother is already as tall as our mother, and he is still growing fast every month."},{"w":"not as…as","p":"adv.","d":"as · C 句型","c":"不如…","s":"This new phone is not as expensive as the one I bought last year, but it takes much better pictures."},{"w":"as tall as his father","p":"adv.","d":"as · C 句型","c":"和他爸爸一樣高","s":"Peter is only thirteen, but he is already as tall as his father, so he has to buy new clothes often."}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"as (2) – back","cards":[{"w":"twice as big as","p":"adv.","d":"as · C 句型","c":"是…的兩倍大","s":"The new gym at our school is twice as big as the old one, so two teams can play basketball together."},{"w":"as much as possible","p":"adv.","d":"as · C 句型","c":"盡可能多","s":"Before the big test, Jenny tried to read as much as possible, and she even studied on the bus every morning."},{"w":"as early as possible","p":"adv.","d":"as · C 句型","c":"越早越好","s":"On the day of the trip, please come to the school gate as early as possible, because the bus leaves at seven."},{"w":"put aside","p":"adv.","d":"aside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"放到一邊；存下","s":"I put aside my homework for a while and helped my mother cook dinner, because she looked really tired."},{"w":"step aside","p":"adv.","d":"aside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"站到旁邊","s":"The old man asked the children to step aside so that the people with heavy bags could get off the bus first."},{"w":"set aside some money","p":"adv.","d":"aside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"存一些錢","s":"My grandmother told me to set aside some money every month, so I can buy a new bike next year."},{"w":"aside from","p":"adv.","d":"aside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"除了…之外","s":"Aside from the long drive, the trip to the beach was wonderful, and the children swam all afternoon."},{"w":"right away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"馬上","s":"When I saw my little sister fall off her bike, I ran to her right away to see if she was hurt."},{"w":"far away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很遠","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live far away in the mountains, so it takes us about three hours to drive there."},{"w":"go away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"走開","s":"The dog kept barking at the cat, but the cat did not go away and just sat quietly on the wall."},{"w":"run away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"逃走","s":"The thief tried to run away with the woman's bag, but two young men caught him at the corner."},{"w":"put away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"收好","s":"Please put away your books and pencils, because dinner is ready and we need the table to eat."},{"w":"give away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"送掉；洩漏","s":"My sister decided to give away her old toys to the children in the hospital before the Christmas holidays."},{"w":"throw away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"丟掉","s":"Do not throw away the empty bottles, because we can wash them and use them to grow small plants."},{"w":"take away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"帶走；外帶","s":"The restaurant was too crowded, so we ordered two bowls of beef noodles to take away and ate them at home."},{"w":"stay away from","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遠離","s":"The doctor told my father to stay away from sweet drinks and fried food if he wants to lose weight."},{"w":"pass away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"過世","s":"My grandfather passed away last winter at the age of ninety, and we all miss his funny stories very much."},{"w":"get away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"逃離；度假","s":"After a busy month of tests, my family wants to get away to the beach for a few quiet days."},{"w":"two miles away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"兩英里遠","s":"The nearest train station is two miles away from our house, so my father drives me there every morning."},{"w":"a week away","p":"adv.","d":"away · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還有一週","s":"The big English test is only a week away, so I need to review all the new words every night."},{"w":"come back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回來","s":"My father promised to come back from Japan before my birthday, so I hope his plane will not be late."},{"w":"go back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回去","s":"After living in the city for five years, my aunt decided to go back to her small town by the sea."},{"w":"give back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"歸還","s":"You should give back the book to the library this week, or you will have to pay some money for being late."},{"w":"call back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回電","s":"Mom was busy cooking dinner when Aunt Lily called, so she promised to call her back after we finished eating."},{"w":"pay back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還錢；報復","s":"Tom borrowed two hundred dollars from me last week, and he said he would pay me back on Friday."},{"w":"take back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"收回（話）","s":"I said something mean to my sister this morning, and now I really want to take it back and say sorry."},{"w":"look back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回顧","s":"When my grandfather looks back on his school days, he always smiles and tells us funny stories about his friends."},{"w":"back and forth","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"來回","s":"The little boy ran back and forth between the kitchen and the living room because he was so excited about the party."},{"w":"back then","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"那時候","s":"Back then, nobody had a phone, so my parents wrote letters to each other every week and waited many days for an answer."},{"w":"back home","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回家；在家鄉","s":"After studying in Taipei for three years, my cousin finally went back home to see his old friends in Tainan."},{"w":"back to school","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"開學","s":"Summer vacation is over, and the stores are full of parents buying bags and pencils because it is time to go back to school."},{"w":"get back to","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回到；回覆","s":"The teacher told us she was busy now but would get back to our questions about the trip after lunch."},{"w":"sit back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"靜靜坐著","s":"On Sunday afternoon, Dad likes to sit back on the sofa with a cup of tea and listen to old songs."},{"w":"be back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回來了","s":"Please wait here for a few minutes because the doctor will be back as soon as he finishes his phone call."},{"w":"way back","p":"adv.","d":"back · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很久以前","s":"Way back when my grandmother was a girl, most people in her village walked to school because there were no buses."}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"backward – close","cards":[{"w":"walk backward","p":"adv.","d":"backward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"往後走","s":"In the game, you have to walk backward across the room without looking, and everyone laughs when someone falls."},{"w":"look backward","p":"adv.","d":"backward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"往後看","s":"Do not look backward when you ride your bike down the hill, or you may hit a tree or a stone."},{"w":"move backward","p":"adv.","d":"backward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"後退","s":"The driver had to move backward slowly because a big truck was blocking the narrow road in front of him."},{"w":"backward and forward","p":"adv.","d":"backward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"前後來回","s":"The baby laughed a lot as her father pushed the swing backward and forward in the park on a sunny afternoon."},{"w":"count backward","p":"adv.","d":"backward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"倒數","s":"Before the new year begins, people on TV count backward from ten to one, and then everyone shouts Happy New Year."},{"w":"backward（向後）","p":"adv.","d":"backward · P 易混淆","c":"backward 是方向","s":"The word backward tells you the direction, so when the teacher says step backward, you should move toward the wall behind you."},{"w":"step backward","p":"adv.","d":"backward · P 易混淆","c":"往後退一步","s":"When the big dog came near, the little girl took a step backward and quickly held her mother's hand."},{"w":"the day before","p":"adv.","d":"before · A 延伸義／程度","c":"前一天","s":"We had a big test on Monday, so I studied until midnight the day before and felt very tired in class."},{"w":"the night before","p":"adv.","d":"before · A 延伸義／程度","c":"前一晚","s":"Jenny could not sleep well the night before her first trip to Japan because she was too excited about it."},{"w":"never before","p":"adv.","d":"before · A 延伸義／程度","c":"以前從未","s":"I have never before seen so much snow in my life, so I ran outside and took many pictures."},{"w":"as before","p":"adv.","d":"before · A 延伸義／程度","c":"和以前一樣","s":"The restaurant changed its name last month, but the noodles taste as good as before, so we still eat there every week."},{"w":"before long","p":"adv.","d":"before · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不久之後","s":"It is raining hard now, but the weather report says the sun will come out before long, so let's wait a little."},{"w":"long before","p":"adv.","d":"before · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很久以前","s":"My grandfather and grandmother got married long before I was born, and they still hold hands when they walk in the park."},{"w":"before（之前；可接子句）","p":"adv.","d":"before · P 易混淆","c":"before 可當連接詞","s":"Before you go out to play basketball with your friends, you must finish your homework and clean your room."},{"w":"I had seen it before.","p":"adv.","d":"before · P 易混淆","c":"我以前看過。","s":"When my friend showed me the movie, I told him that I had seen it before, but I watched it again anyway."},{"w":"Besides, it's cheap.","p":"adv.","d":"besides · A 延伸義／程度","c":"而且它很便宜。","s":"This little restaurant near our school has really good noodles, and besides, it is cheap, so students love eating there."},{"w":"besides me","p":"adv.","d":"besides · A 延伸義／程度","c":"除了我之外還有","s":"Three other students besides me got full marks on the English test, so the teacher gave all of us a small gift."},{"w":"What else, besides this?","p":"adv.","d":"besides · A 延伸義／程度","c":"除了這個還有什麼？","s":"We already have eggs, milk, and bread in the basket, so what else do we need to buy besides this?"},{"w":"besides（此外，附加）","p":"adv.","d":"besides · P 易混淆","c":"besides 表「還有」","s":"Besides English and math, Amy also studies music and art on Saturdays, so she is always very busy."},{"w":"Everyone came besides Tom.","p":"adv.","d":"besides · P 易混淆","c":"除了湯姆還有大家都來了（含湯姆）。","s":"Everyone in our class came to the party besides Tom, so there were more than thirty people in the small room."},{"w":"come close","p":"adv.","d":"close · A 延伸義／程度","c":"靠近","s":"The shy cat finally came close to me when I sat still on the floor and held out a small piece of fish."},{"w":"close by","p":"adv.","d":"close · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在附近","s":"My grandmother lives close by, so I can walk to her house in five minutes and have dinner with her every weekend."},{"w":"close to the station","p":"adv.","d":"close · A 延伸義／程度","c":"靠近車站","s":"We found a nice hotel close to the station, so it was easy to catch the early train the next morning."},{"w":"close to a hundred","p":"adv.","d":"close · A 延伸義／程度","c":"接近一百","s":"Close to a hundred students joined the school sports day this year, so the games lasted almost three hours."},{"w":"stay close","p":"adv.","d":"close · A 延伸義／程度","c":"待在附近","s":"The night market was very crowded, so Mom told my little brother to stay close and not let go of her hand."},{"w":"close together","p":"adv.","d":"close · A 延伸義／程度","c":"緊靠在一起","s":"It was so cold on the mountain that the five of us sat close together around the fire and shared one blanket."},{"w":"close（接近地）","p":"adv.","d":"close · P 易混淆","c":"close 當副詞指距離","s":"The word close tells us about distance, so when my teacher said sit close, I moved my chair next to hers."},{"w":"closely（仔細地；密切地）","p":"adv.","d":"close · P 易混淆","c":"closely 指方式","s":"The word closely tells us about the way we do something, so the doctor watched the sick child closely all night."},{"w":"Stand close to me.","p":"adv.","d":"close · P 易混淆","c":"站靠近我。","s":"It is very dark on this road, so please stand close to me and hold the flashlight while we wait for the bus."},{"w":"Look closely.","p":"adv.","d":"close · P 易混淆","c":"仔細看。","s":"If you look closely at this old picture, you can see my grandfather standing in the back row with a big smile."}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"daily – down","cards":[{"w":"daily life","p":"adv.","d":"daily · A 延伸義／程度","c":"日常生活","s":"Learning English is useful in daily life because we see English words on signs, menus, and computers every day."},{"w":"a daily newspaper","p":"adv.","d":"daily · A 延伸義／程度","c":"日報","s":"My father reads a daily newspaper at breakfast every morning, and he likes to talk about the news with us."},{"w":"twice daily","p":"adv.","d":"daily · A 延伸義／程度","c":"每天兩次","s":"The doctor told my grandmother to take this small white pill twice daily, once after breakfast and once after dinner."},{"w":"daily use","p":"adv.","d":"daily · A 延伸義／程度","c":"日常使用","s":"These cheap cups and plates are for daily use, and we keep the beautiful ones for special days like New Year."},{"w":"exercise daily","p":"adv.","d":"daily · A 延伸義／程度","c":"每天運動","s":"My uncle is sixty years old, but he looks young and strong because he exercises daily in the park near his house."},{"w":"daily（每天）","p":"adv.","d":"daily · P 易混淆","c":"daily 可當形容詞與副詞","s":"We can use daily in two ways, so my father takes a daily walk, and we can also say that he walks daily."},{"w":"deep down","p":"adv.","d":"deep · A 延伸義／程度","c":"內心深處","s":"Lisa says she does not care about the game, but deep down she really hopes her team will win the final."},{"w":"dig deep","p":"adv.","d":"deep · A 延伸義／程度","c":"深入挖掘；用心","s":"The math problem was very hard, but Kevin had to dig deep and think for a long time before he found the answer."},{"w":"deep in thought","p":"adv.","d":"deep · A 延伸義／程度","c":"沉思中","s":"My brother was deep in thought at the dinner table, so he did not hear Mom calling his name three times."},{"w":"deep into the night","p":"adv.","d":"deep · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直到深夜","s":"The two friends talked deep into the night about their dreams, and they finally went to sleep at three in the morning."},{"w":"breathe deep","p":"adv.","d":"deep · A 延伸義／程度","c":"深呼吸","s":"Before the big race began, the coach told us to breathe deep, close our eyes, and think about running well."},{"w":"deep in the forest","p":"adv.","d":"deep · A 延伸義／程度","c":"森林深處","s":"Deep in the forest, we found a small clear lake, and there were many birds singing in the tall trees around it."},{"w":"deep（深深地；具體）","p":"adv.","d":"deep · P 易混淆","c":"deep 副詞指實際深度","s":"When deep tells about a real distance, it does not need an extra ending, so the dog dug deep in the garden and made a hole."},{"w":"deeply（深深地；抽象）","p":"adv.","d":"deep · P 易混淆","c":"deeply 指情感程度","s":"When we talk about strong feelings, we use deeply instead of deep, so I felt deeply sad when my friend moved away."},{"w":"deeply moved","p":"adv.","d":"deep · P 易混淆","c":"深受感動","s":"Everyone in the room was deeply moved by the old man's story about his lost dog, and some people even cried."},{"w":"deeply in love","p":"adv.","d":"deep · P 易混淆","c":"深深愛上","s":"In the movie, the young prince falls deeply in love with a poor girl, and his parents are not happy about it."},{"w":"calm down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"冷靜下來","s":"When my little sister lost her favorite toy, Mom asked her to calm down first and then helped her look for it."},{"w":"sit down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"坐下","s":"After standing on the bus for one hour, Grandpa was happy to sit down on a bench and rest his tired legs."},{"w":"slow down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"慢下來","s":"The road was wet after the rain, so Dad had to slow down and drive more carefully around every corner."},{"w":"turn down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"拒絕；調小","s":"Grandma turned down the TV because the baby was sleeping, and she also turned down my idea of having a loud party."},{"w":"write down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"寫下","s":"Please write down the teacher's phone number in your notebook, or you may forget it before you get home tonight."},{"w":"break down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"故障；崩潰","s":"Our old car broke down on the way to the beach, so we had to wait two hours for help under the hot sun."},{"w":"cut down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"減少；砍倒","s":"The doctor told my father to cut down on sweet drinks and eat more vegetables if he wanted to be healthier."},{"w":"let sb. down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"讓人失望","s":"I promised to help Peter with his science project, so I cannot let him down even though I am very busy this week."},{"w":"look down on","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"看不起","s":"A good student should never look down on friends who get low grades, because everyone has something they are good at."},{"w":"put down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"放下","s":"The box was too heavy for the little girl, so her father asked her to put it down and rest for a while."},{"w":"get down to","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"開始認真做","s":"After playing games all afternoon, Jack finally turned off the computer and got down to his English homework at nine."},{"w":"up and down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"上上下下","s":"The excited children jumped up and down on the bed when they heard that the family was going to the zoo."},{"w":"feel down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"心情低落","s":"Mary felt down after she failed the test, so her friends took her out for ice cream to cheer her up."},{"w":"come down with","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"生（病）","s":"Many students came down with a cold after the rainy sports day, so half of the seats in our class were empty on Monday."},{"w":"price goes down","p":"adv.","d":"down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"價格下跌","s":"When the price of fruit goes down in summer, my mother always buys a lot of mangoes and makes cold drinks for us."}]},{"unit":8,"theme":"downstairs – else","cards":[{"w":"go downstairs","p":"adv.","d":"downstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下樓","s":"Every morning I go downstairs to have breakfast with my family before I brush my teeth and get ready for school."},{"w":"come downstairs","p":"adv.","d":"downstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下樓來","s":"Dinner is ready, so please come downstairs now, or the soup will get cold and your father will not be happy."},{"w":"the family downstairs","p":"adv.","d":"downstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"樓下的那家人","s":"The family downstairs has a new baby, so we try to be quiet at night and never play loud music."},{"w":"wait downstairs","p":"adv.","d":"downstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在樓下等","s":"My friends will wait downstairs at seven, so I have to finish my dinner quickly and change my clothes."},{"w":"go downstairs（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"downstairs · P 易混淆","c":"downstairs 前不加介係詞","s":"We say go downstairs without the word to, so my teacher corrected me when I said I would go to downstairs."},{"w":"run downstairs","p":"adv.","d":"downstairs · P 易混淆","c":"跑下樓","s":"When the children heard the ice cream truck outside, they ran downstairs so fast that they almost fell on the steps."},{"w":"early in the morning","p":"adv.","d":"early · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一大早","s":"Early in the morning, before the sun comes up, my grandfather walks to the park to exercise with his old friends."},{"w":"get up early","p":"adv.","d":"early · A 延伸義／程度","c":"早起","s":"On school days I have to get up early at six, so I always go to bed before ten at night."},{"w":"early bird","p":"adv.","d":"early · A 延伸義／程度","c":"早起的人","s":"My sister is an early bird who finishes her homework before breakfast, but I like to stay up late and sleep in."},{"w":"an early train","p":"adv.","d":"early · A 延伸義／程度","c":"早班車","s":"We took an early train to Tainan on Saturday, so we had the whole day to visit the old temples and night markets."},{"w":"arrive early","p":"adv.","d":"early · A 延伸義／程度","c":"提早到","s":"Students who arrive early at the test center can find their seats slowly and feel less nervous before the test begins."},{"w":"early on","p":"adv.","d":"early · A 延伸義／程度","c":"早期；一開始","s":"Early on, I thought learning the guitar would be easy, but after a few weeks I found out it takes a lot of practice."},{"w":"early（早）","p":"adv.","d":"early · P 易混淆","c":"early 形容詞與副詞同形","s":"Early does not change its form, so we can talk about an early bus and also say that Grandpa always gets up early."},{"w":"Come early.","p":"adv.","d":"early · P 易混淆","c":"早點來。","s":"The movie starts at seven, so please come early if you want to buy popcorn and find a good seat together."},{"w":"Me either.","p":"adv.","d":"either · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我也不。","s":"When Amy said she did not like the long boring movie at all, her little brother quickly added, Me either."},{"w":"either way","p":"adv.","d":"either · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不管哪一種","s":"We can take the bus or the train to the beach, and either way we will get there before noon."},{"w":"either of them","p":"adv.","d":"either · A 延伸義／程度","c":"他們兩個之中任一個","s":"Both of these dresses look nice on you, so you can choose either of them, and I will pay for it."},{"w":"on either side","p":"adv.","d":"either · A 延伸義／程度","c":"兩邊都","s":"There are tall green trees on either side of the road, so it feels cool even on hot summer afternoons."},{"w":"either you or I","p":"adv.","d":"either · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你或我","s":"Either you or I have to stay home with Grandma tonight, so let's decide quickly before the others leave."},{"w":"not…either（也不）","p":"adv.","d":"either · P 易混淆","c":"否定句句尾用 either","s":"In a negative sentence we put either at the end, so I can say that I do not like fish, and my sister does not, either."},{"w":"either…or（不是…就是）","p":"adv.","d":"either · P 易混淆","c":"either…or 二選一","s":"For dinner tonight, we can either cook noodles at home or go out for pizza, but we cannot do both."},{"w":"I can't swim, either.","p":"adv.","d":"either · P 易混淆","c":"我也不會游泳。","s":"My brother cannot swim, and I cannot swim, either, so our parents decided to send both of us to a swim class this summer."},{"w":"something else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"其他東西","s":"This soup has too much salt for me, so could you bring me something else from the kitchen, like a bowl of rice?"},{"w":"someone else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"別人","s":"That is not my bag because mine is blue, so it must belong to someone else in our class."},{"w":"anything else?","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還要別的嗎？","s":"The waiter brought our drinks and asked with a smile, Anything else, or are you ready to order your food now?"},{"w":"nothing else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"沒有別的了","s":"I have finished all my homework, and there is nothing else to do tonight, so may I play games for an hour?"},{"w":"or else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"否則","s":"You need to leave the house before seven, or else you will miss the school bus and be late for class."},{"w":"what else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還有什麼","s":"We have already packed our clothes, shoes, and books for the trip, so what else should we put in the bag?"},{"w":"somewhere else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"其他地方","s":"This restaurant is full and very noisy tonight, so let's go somewhere else for dinner, maybe the noodle shop around the corner."},{"w":"everyone else","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"其他每個人","s":"Everyone else in the class has finished the test, but Kevin is still working on the last question with a worried face."},{"w":"Who else?","p":"adv.","d":"else · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還有誰？","s":"Lisa and Jack are coming to my birthday party, but who else should I invite so that we have enough people for games?"}]},{"unit":9,"theme":"enough – even","cards":[{"w":"good enough","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"夠好","s":"My drawing is not perfect, but my art teacher says it is good enough to put on the wall for the school show."},{"w":"old enough to","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"年紀夠大可以","s":"My brother is now old enough to ride his bike to school alone, but Mom still worries about him every morning."},{"w":"enough money","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"夠多的錢","s":"I have saved money for six months, so now I have enough money to buy the new game I have wanted."},{"w":"Enough is enough.","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"夠了就是夠了。","s":"After the dog ate my shoes for the third time this month, Dad looked at it and said, Enough is enough."},{"w":"That's enough!","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"夠了！","s":"The two boys kept fighting over the ball until their mother shouted, That's enough, and sent them both to their rooms."},{"w":"more than enough","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"綽綽有餘","s":"Grandma cooked more than enough food for the party, so every guest took a box of dumplings home after the party."},{"w":"sure enough","p":"adv.","d":"enough · A 延伸義／程度","c":"果然","s":"The weather report said it would rain in the afternoon, and sure enough, big drops started falling just after lunch."},{"w":"adj. + enough to V","p":"adv.","d":"enough · C 句型","c":"夠…可以…","s":"The water in the pool was warm enough to swim in, so the kids jumped in and played with joy for two hours."},{"w":"tall enough to reach","p":"adv.","d":"enough · C 句型","c":"高到可以碰到","s":"My little sister is finally tall enough to reach the cookies on the top shelf, so now Mom hides them somewhere else."},{"w":"enough + n. + to V","p":"adv.","d":"enough · C 句型","c":"有足夠的…可以","s":"We do not have enough time to walk to the station, so we should take a taxi if we want to catch the train."},{"w":"not fast enough to win","p":"adv.","d":"enough · C 句型","c":"不夠快，無法贏","s":"Tom practiced hard for the race, but he was still not fast enough to win, so he will try again next year."},{"w":"enough 放形容詞後","p":"adv.","d":"enough · C 句型","c":"enough 置於形容詞之後","s":"Remember that enough comes after words like big or tall, so we say the room is big enough, not the room is enough big."},{"w":"enough 放名詞前","p":"adv.","d":"enough · C 句型","c":"enough 置於名詞之前","s":"When enough is used with things like chairs or money, it comes first, so we say enough chairs for everyone, not chairs enough."},{"w":"especially for you","p":"adv.","d":"especially · A 延伸義／程度","c":"特別為你","s":"Grandma baked this chocolate cake especially for you because she knows it is your favorite and today is your birthday."},{"w":"especially in summer","p":"adv.","d":"especially · A 延伸義／程度","c":"特別是在夏天","s":"Taipei is very hot and wet, especially in summer, so many people carry a small towel and a bottle of water."},{"w":"I like fruit, especially apples.","p":"adv.","d":"especially · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我喜歡水果，尤其是蘋果。","s":"I like all kinds of fruit, especially apples, so my mother buys a big bag of them every week at the market."},{"w":"not especially","p":"adv.","d":"especially · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不特別；不怎麼","s":"I was not especially hungry after the big lunch, so I only had a small bowl of soup for dinner."},{"w":"especially（尤其）","p":"adv.","d":"especially · P 易混淆","c":"especially 強調其中之一","s":"We use especially to point out one thing from a group, so I enjoy sports, especially basketball with my friends after school."},{"w":"especially when it rains","p":"adv.","d":"especially · P 易混淆","c":"尤其是下雨時","s":"Riding a bike to school can be dangerous, especially when it rains, because the roads become wet and cars cannot stop quickly."},{"w":"even better","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"甚至更好","s":"The pizza at this new shop is good, but the one at my uncle's restaurant is even better, so we go there more often."},{"w":"even if","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"即使","s":"We will go hiking on Sunday even if it rains, so remember to bring a raincoat and a pair of old shoes."},{"w":"even though","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"雖然","s":"Even though Jenny was very tired after the game, she still helped her mother wash the dishes and clean the kitchen."},{"w":"even so","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"即便如此","s":"The weather was cold and windy that day, but even so, hundreds of people came to the park to see the flowers."},{"w":"not even one","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"連一個也沒有","s":"I looked for my favorite cookies in three stores, but I could not find even one box, so I went home sad."},{"w":"even now","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"即使到現在","s":"My grandmother moved to the city twenty years ago, but even now she still misses the quiet little village where she grew up."},{"w":"even a child knows","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"連小孩都知道","s":"Even a child knows that we should not throw trash into the river, so why do some adults still do it?"},{"w":"even more","p":"adv.","d":"even · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更加","s":"After a week of rain, the students were even more excited about the sunny weather and ran to the playground at lunch."},{"w":"even + 比較級","p":"adv.","d":"even · C 句型","c":"even 加強比較級","s":"We can put even before a comparing word to make it stronger, so after the rain the river was even higher than this morning."},{"w":"even colder than yesterday","p":"adv.","d":"even · C 句型","c":"比昨天還冷","s":"Put on your heavy coat and a hat today because the weather report says it will be even colder than yesterday."},{"w":"even worse","p":"adv.","d":"even · C 句型","c":"更糟","s":"I failed the math test last week, but this week my score was even worse, so I need to ask the teacher for help."},{"w":"even + 主詞（連…都）","p":"adv.","d":"even · C 句型","c":"even 強調主詞","s":"We can put even before the subject to show surprise, so even my quiet grandfather sang loudly at the party last night."},{"w":"Even the teacher laughed.","p":"adv.","d":"even · C 句型","c":"連老師都笑了。","s":"Kevin told such a funny joke in class that even the teacher laughed, and she forgot to give us homework that day."}]},{"unit":10,"theme":"ever – far","cards":[{"w":"ever since","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"自從…一直","s":"Mary and I have been best friends ever since we met on the first day of school three years ago."},{"w":"for ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"永遠","s":"The old man wished that the beautiful summer day could last for ever, so he sat by the sea until the sun went down."},{"w":"hardly ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎不曾","s":"My father hardly ever eats sweets because he worries about his teeth, but on his birthday he always has one piece of cake."},{"w":"ever after","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從此以後","s":"The prince and the princess got married in a big castle and lived in joy ever after, just like in every old story."},{"w":"the best movie ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有史以來最好的電影","s":"My brother says this is the best movie ever, so he has already watched it four times with different friends."},{"w":"more than ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"比以前更","s":"After the long school year, the students were looking forward to summer vacation more than ever and counted the days until July."},{"w":"as ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一如往常","s":"Grandpa is eighty now, but he is as happy as ever and still tells the same old jokes every Sunday at lunch."},{"w":"Have you ever…?","p":"adv.","d":"ever · C 句型","c":"你曾經…嗎？","s":"We use Have you ever to ask about any time in the past, so my teacher asked, Have you ever tried Japanese food?"},{"w":"Have you ever been to Japan?","p":"adv.","d":"ever · C 句型","c":"你去過日本嗎？","s":"Have you ever been to Japan in winter, because my family is going there next month and we want some ideas?"},{"w":"Nobody has ever seen it.","p":"adv.","d":"ever · C 句型","c":"沒人見過它。","s":"There is a strange animal living in the mountains behind our school, but nobody has ever seen it during the day."},{"w":"the + 最高級 + ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · C 句型","c":"有史以來最…","s":"To make something sound really special, we put ever after words like best or kindest, so my mother says I am the kindest son ever."},{"w":"the tallest building ever","p":"adv.","d":"ever · C 句型","c":"有史以來最高的建築","s":"Taipei 101 was once the tallest building ever built, and many people still visit it to see the whole city at night."},{"w":"everywhere you go","p":"adv.","d":"everywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你去的每個地方","s":"Everywhere you go in Taiwan, you can find a small store that is open all night, so you never worry about buying a drink."},{"w":"look everywhere","p":"adv.","d":"everywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到處找","s":"I looked everywhere for my glasses this morning, under the bed and in my bag, and finally found them on my head."},{"w":"everywhere in town","p":"adv.","d":"everywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"鎮上每個地方","s":"During the festival, there are colorful lights everywhere in town, so the streets look like a beautiful river of stars at night."},{"w":"People everywhere love music.","p":"adv.","d":"everywhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"各地的人都愛音樂。","s":"People everywhere love music, so even if you cannot speak the language, you can still sing and dance together with new friends."},{"w":"everywhere（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"everywhere · P 易混淆","c":"everywhere 前不加介係詞","s":"We never put to before everywhere, so my teacher told me to say I want to go everywhere, not go to everywhere."},{"w":"so far","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到目前為止","s":"We have read three lessons so far this month, and the teacher says we will finish two more before the test."},{"w":"far from","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"離…很遠；一點也不","s":"My new school is far from my house, so I have to leave home at six thirty to catch the bus."},{"w":"by far","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"（最高級前）遠遠地","s":"Jenny is by far the fastest runner in our class, so she always wins the race on sports day without any trouble."},{"w":"how far","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多遠","s":"Could you tell me how far it is from here to the train station, because my legs are tired and I may need a taxi?"},{"w":"far from easy","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一點也不容易","s":"Learning to play the violin is far from easy, so you must practice every day and not give up when it sounds bad."},{"w":"go too far","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"做得太過火","s":"It is fine to joke with your friends, but when you laugh at someone's family, you go too far and hurt them."},{"w":"far too expensive","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太貴了","s":"That shirt looks nice, but it is far too expensive for a student, so let's look for something cheaper in another store."},{"w":"far better","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好太多了","s":"My grades were far better this year because I turned off my phone and studied for one hour every night."},{"w":"not far from here","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"離這裡不遠","s":"The hospital is not far from here, so you can walk there in about ten minutes if you go straight along this road."},{"w":"as far as the station","p":"adv.","d":"far · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直到車站","s":"We walked as far as the station with our teacher, and then she said goodbye and we took the bus home by ourselves."},{"w":"far + 比較級","p":"adv.","d":"far · C 句型","c":"far 加強比較級","s":"We can put far before a comparing word to make it stronger, so this summer is far hotter than last summer."},{"w":"far more interesting","p":"adv.","d":"far · C 句型","c":"有趣得多","s":"The book about space is far more interesting than the one about cars, so I finished it in only two days."},{"w":"by far the best","p":"adv.","d":"far · C 句型","c":"絕對是最好的","s":"Grandma's beef noodles are by far the best in town, and people wait in a long line outside her shop every weekend."},{"w":"How far is it?","p":"adv.","d":"far · C 句型","c":"有多遠？","s":"How far is it from your house to the beach, and should we ride there or ask your father to drive us?"}]},{"unit":11,"theme":"fast – forward","cards":[{"w":"fast asleep","p":"adv.","d":"fast · A 延伸義／程度","c":"睡得很熟","s":"When I got home from the long trip, my little brother was already fast asleep on the sofa with the TV still on."},{"w":"hold fast","p":"adv.","d":"fast · A 延伸義／程度","c":"緊緊抓住","s":"The wind on the bridge was very strong, so Dad told us to hold fast to his hand and walk slowly."},{"w":"a fast food restaurant","p":"adv.","d":"fast · A 延伸義／程度","c":"速食店","s":"There is a fast food restaurant next to our school, but Mom says we should not eat hamburgers and fries every day."},{"w":"run fast","p":"adv.","d":"fast · A 延伸義／程度","c":"跑得快","s":"My dog can run fast, so when I throw a ball in the park, he brings it back before I count to five."},{"w":"too fast to catch","p":"adv.","d":"fast · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快到追不上","s":"The thief ran too fast to catch, so the police officer called for help on his radio and jumped into his car."},{"w":"fast friends","p":"adv.","d":"fast · A 延伸義／程度","c":"摯友","s":"Lisa and Amy became fast friends on the first day of school, and now they do everything together, even homework."},{"w":"fast（快；形容詞與副詞同形）","p":"adv.","d":"fast · P 易混淆","c":"fast 無 -ly 形式","s":"Fast does not change its form, so we can talk about a fast car and also say that the car goes very fast."},{"w":"fastly（錯誤用法）","p":"adv.","d":"fast · P 易混淆","c":"沒有 fastly 這個字","s":"There is no such word as fastly in English, so do not say he runs fastly, but say he runs fast instead."},{"w":"drive fast","p":"adv.","d":"fast · P 易混淆","c":"開得快","s":"My uncle likes to drive fast on the empty country roads at night, but my aunt always tells him to slow down."},{"w":"Finally, we won.","p":"adv.","d":"finally · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我們終於贏了。","s":"Our team lost the first three games this year, but we practiced every afternoon, and finally, we won the last one."},{"w":"finally arrive","p":"adv.","d":"finally · A 延伸義／程度","c":"終於抵達","s":"After a long train ride and a two-hour walk up the mountain, we finally arrived at the little hotel just before dark."},{"w":"Finally, I want to say…","p":"adv.","d":"finally · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最後，我想說…","s":"Finally, I want to say thank you to all my teachers and friends for helping me so much this year."},{"w":"finally understand","p":"adv.","d":"finally · A 延伸義／程度","c":"終於明白","s":"After the teacher explained the math problem three times, I finally understand how to solve it."},{"w":"finally（最後；終於）","p":"adv.","d":"finally · P 易混淆","c":"finally 表順序或結果","s":"We waited at the bus stop for forty minutes in the rain, and the bus finally came at seven."},{"w":"at first","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"起初","s":"At first I did not like my new school, but now I have many good friends here."},{"w":"first come, first served","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"先到先得","s":"The shop only has fifty free cakes for the party, so it is first come, first served."},{"w":"safety first","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"安全第一","s":"Our teacher always says safety first, so we must look both ways before we cross the busy road."},{"w":"for the first time","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"第一次","s":"Last summer my grandmother got on a plane for the first time, and she was very excited."},{"w":"at first sight","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"第一眼","s":"When Mary saw the little brown puppy at the pet shop, she loved it at first sight."},{"w":"put family first","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"把家庭放第一","s":"My father always puts family first, so he comes home early to have dinner with us every night."},{"w":"head first","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"頭先著地","s":"Tom fell head first into the pool when he ran too fast, but luckily he was not hurt."},{"w":"ladies first","p":"adv.","d":"first · A 延伸義／程度","c":"女士優先","s":"When we got to the door, Peter smiled, held it open, and said, ladies first, to his mother."},{"w":"first（首先；第一）","p":"adv.","d":"first · P 易混淆","c":"first 表順序第一","s":"First, you need to turn on the computer, and then you can open the game and start playing."},{"w":"at first（起初，後來改變）","p":"adv.","d":"first · P 易混淆","c":"at first 暗示後來不同","s":"At first the water in the pool felt very cold, but after five minutes we all had fun in it."},{"w":"firstly（第一點）","p":"adv.","d":"first · P 易混淆","c":"firstly 用於列舉","s":"There are two reasons I love my town; firstly, the food is great, and second, the people are kind."},{"w":"the first time（第一次）","p":"adv.","d":"first · P 易混淆","c":"the first time + 子句","s":"The first time I rode a horse, I was so afraid that I held its neck and closed my eyes."},{"w":"first（副詞，不加 at）","p":"adv.","d":"first · P 易混淆","c":"first 單用即可","s":"When you get to the station, first buy a ticket, and then wait for the train on the second floor."},{"w":"look forward to","p":"adv.","d":"forward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"期待","s":"All the students look forward to the school trip to the beach next week because the weather will be sunny."},{"w":"move forward","p":"adv.","d":"forward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"前進","s":"Even though we lost the game, our coach told us to move forward and get ready for the next one."},{"w":"step forward","p":"adv.","d":"forward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"向前一步","s":"When the teacher asked who broke the window, Jack took a step forward and said it was him."},{"w":"go forward","p":"adv.","d":"forward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"往前走","s":"If you go forward along this road for ten minutes, you will see the post office on your left."},{"w":"put the clock forward","p":"adv.","d":"forward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"把時鐘調快","s":"Every spring, people in some countries put the clock forward one hour to enjoy more sun in the evening."},{"w":"from this day forward","p":"adv.","d":"forward · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從今天起","s":"From this day forward, I will get up early, eat a good breakfast, and never be late for school again."},{"w":"look forward to + V-ing","p":"adv.","d":"forward · C 句型","c":"look forward to 接動名詞","s":"My little sister looks forward to going to the zoo on Sunday because she wants to see the pandas."},{"w":"look forward to seeing you","p":"adv.","d":"forward · C 句型","c":"期待見到你","s":"We have not met since last summer, so I really look forward to seeing you at the party on Saturday."},{"w":"look forward to the trip","p":"adv.","d":"forward · C 句型","c":"期待這次旅行","s":"The whole family looks forward to the trip to Japan, and my mom has already bought a new camera."}]},{"unit":12,"theme":"free – hard","cards":[{"w":"for free","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"免費","s":"If you buy two hamburgers at this restaurant today, you can get a large drink for free."},{"w":"free of charge","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"免費","s":"Children under six can enter the museum free of charge, but their parents have to pay one hundred dollars."},{"w":"set free","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"釋放","s":"The kind farmer found a bird in a net, and he set it free so it could fly back to its family."},{"w":"feel free to","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"請隨意","s":"If you have any questions about the homework, please feel free to call me or send me an email tonight."},{"w":"free time","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"空閒時間","s":"In my free time, I like to ride my bike in the park or read comic books in my bedroom."},{"w":"free from worry","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"無憂無慮","s":"When my grandfather sits by the river and fishes all afternoon, he is free from worry and very happy."},{"w":"sugar-free","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"無糖","s":"My mother always buys sugar-free drinks for my little brother because she does not want him to get fat."},{"w":"Are you free tonight?","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"今晚有空嗎？","s":"Are you free tonight? My family is going to have a barbecue in the yard, and we want you to come."},{"w":"a free seat","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"空位","s":"The train was very full, so the old woman was happy when a young man gave her a free seat."},{"w":"run free","p":"adv.","d":"free · A 延伸義／程度","c":"自由奔跑","s":"On Sunday afternoon, our dog loves to run free on the big green field behind the school."},{"w":"free（免費地；自由地）","p":"adv.","d":"free · P 易混淆","c":"free 當副詞指免費","s":"Students with a school card can ride the city bus free on weekends, so we often go downtown together."},{"w":"freely（自由地；隨意地）","p":"adv.","d":"free · P 易混淆","c":"freely 指方式","s":"In the art class, the teacher let us paint freely, so everyone drew anything they liked on the paper."},{"w":"speak freely","p":"adv.","d":"free · P 易混淆","c":"暢所欲言","s":"Our class meeting is a place where everyone can speak freely, so please tell us your ideas about the trip."},{"w":"get in free","p":"adv.","d":"free · P 易混淆","c":"免費入場","s":"People who wear a red shirt can get in free at the baseball game tonight, so let's all wear red."},{"w":"work hard","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"努力工作","s":"My mother works hard at the hospital every day, so I try to help her cook dinner at night."},{"w":"study hard","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"用功讀書","s":"If you study hard for the next two weeks, I am sure you will do well on the English test."},{"w":"try hard","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"努力嘗試","s":"Although Ben tried hard to catch the ball, it hit the ground and the other team won the game."},{"w":"rain hard","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下大雨","s":"It rained hard all night, so this morning there was water on the roads and we could not ride our bicycles."},{"w":"think hard","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"努力想","s":"The question was very difficult, so Lisa thought hard for ten minutes before she wrote down her answer."},{"w":"hit hard","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"重擊","s":"The typhoon hit our town hard last night, and many trees fell down on the roads near my house."},{"w":"hard at work","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"埋頭工作","s":"When I walked into the kitchen, my father was hard at work making dumplings for the New Year dinner."},{"w":"a hard time","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"艱難的時期","s":"My family had a hard time last year because my father lost his job and we moved to a smaller house."},{"w":"hard to say","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很難說","s":"It is hard to say who will win the game tonight because both teams have played very well this year."},{"w":"hard of hearing","p":"adv.","d":"hard · A 延伸義／程度","c":"聽力不好","s":"My grandfather is hard of hearing, so we have to speak loudly and slowly when we talk to him on the phone."},{"w":"hard（努力地；猛烈地）","p":"adv.","d":"hard · P 易混淆","c":"hard 副詞與形容詞同形","s":"The wind blew hard all afternoon, and the hard test in the morning also made everyone feel very tired."},{"w":"hardly（幾乎不）","p":"adv.","d":"hard · P 易混淆","c":"hardly 是否定意味","s":"The room was so noisy that I could hardly hear the teacher, so I moved to a seat near the front."},{"w":"He works hard.","p":"adv.","d":"hard · P 易混淆","c":"他工作努力。","s":"He works hard at the factory from morning to night, so he can buy a new bicycle for his daughter."},{"w":"He hardly works.","p":"adv.","d":"hard · P 易混淆","c":"他幾乎不工作。","s":"He hardly works at the shop these days because he is sick, so his wife has to take care of everything."}]},{"unit":13,"theme":"hardly – high","cards":[{"w":"hardly any","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎沒有","s":"There was hardly any milk left in the bottle this morning, so Dad went to the store to buy more."},{"w":"can hardly wait","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"等不及了","s":"My little brother can hardly wait for Christmas because he wants to open the big red box under the tree."},{"w":"hardly anyone","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎沒人","s":"It was raining so hard on Sunday morning that hardly anyone came to the park to play basketball."},{"w":"hardly believe it","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"難以相信","s":"I could hardly believe it when my teacher told me that I got the highest score on the English test."},{"w":"hardly know him","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎不認識他","s":"I hardly know him because he just moved to our class last week and he is very quiet in school."},{"w":"hardly…when…","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · C 句型","c":"一…就…","s":"We had hardly sat down at the restaurant when the waiter brought us the soup and the bread."},{"w":"Hardly had he left when it rained.","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · C 句型","c":"他剛走就下雨了。","s":"Hardly had he left the house when it began to rain hard, so he ran back to get his umbrella."},{"w":"hardly 本身帶否定","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · C 句型","c":"hardly 不與 not 連用","s":"Mary can hardly swim at all, so her father stays near her when they go to the pool on hot days."},{"w":"I can hardly hear you.","p":"adv.","d":"hardly · C 句型","c":"我幾乎聽不到你。","s":"I can hardly hear you because the music in the restaurant is too loud, so please speak a little louder."},{"w":"Here you are.","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"給你。","s":"When I asked my mother for money to buy lunch, she smiled and said, here you are, and gave me fifty dollars."},{"w":"Here we go.","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"開始了。","s":"The teacher smiled and said, here we go, and all the students started to run around the big playground."},{"w":"Here comes the bus.","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"公車來了。","s":"Here comes the bus, so put your phone away, take out your ticket, and get ready to get on quickly."},{"w":"here you go","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你的來了；給你","s":"The waiter put two bowls of hot noodles on our table and said, here you go, enjoy your dinner."},{"w":"from here on","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從現在起","s":"From here on, our class will have an English test every Friday, so please study a little every day."},{"w":"Here it is.","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在這裡。","s":"After I looked for my key for ten minutes, my sister picked it up from the sofa and said, here it is."},{"w":"around here","p":"adv.","d":"here · A 延伸義／程度","c":"這附近","s":"Is there a good night market around here? My friends and I want to try some famous food tonight."},{"w":"come here（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"here · P 易混淆","c":"here 前不加介係詞","s":"Please come here and sit next to me, because I want to show you the photos from my trip to Japan."},{"w":"Here comes + 名詞","p":"adv.","d":"here · P 易混淆","c":"Here + 動詞 + 名詞主詞","s":"Here comes the teacher with our test papers, so everyone should sit down and be quiet right now."},{"w":"Here he comes.","p":"adv.","d":"here · P 易混淆","c":"他來了（代名詞不倒裝）。","s":"We waited for Jack outside the movie theater for a long time, and then Lisa pointed and said, here he comes."},{"w":"Here is your book.","p":"adv.","d":"here · P 易混淆","c":"你的書在這。","s":"Here is your book; I found it under my desk after class, and I think you left it there yesterday."},{"w":"aim high","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"志向遠大","s":"My teacher always tells us to aim high, because if we try our best, our dreams can come true."},{"w":"fly high","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"飛得高","s":"On a windy day, my brother and I went to the park, and our new kite could fly high above the trees."},{"w":"jump high","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"跳得高","s":"The basketball player can jump high and touch the top of the net, so everyone in the gym cheered for him."},{"w":"high up","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在高處","s":"The cat was high up in the old tree, and it was afraid to come down until my father came to help."},{"w":"high in the sky","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"高高在空中","s":"We lay on the grass and watched the airplanes fly high in the sky on a sunny Sunday afternoon."},{"w":"hold one's head high","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"抬頭挺胸","s":"Although our team lost the final game, our coach told us to hold our heads high and be proud of ourselves."},{"w":"knee-high","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"及膝高","s":"After the typhoon, the water on our street was knee-high, so we could not go to school that morning."},{"w":"prices stay high","p":"adv.","d":"high · A 延伸義／程度","c":"價格居高不下","s":"Because of the bad weather this summer, vegetable prices stay high, and my mother is buying fewer tomatoes."},{"w":"high（高高地；具體）","p":"adv.","d":"high · P 易混淆","c":"high 副詞指高度","s":"The young boy climbed high into the old tree to pick some fruit, and his mother told him to be careful."},{"w":"highly（非常；高度地）","p":"adv.","d":"high · P 易混淆","c":"highly 指程度","s":"This new restaurant is highly popular with students because the food is cheap and the service is very fast."},{"w":"highly recommended","p":"adv.","d":"high · P 易混淆","c":"強力推薦","s":"This book is highly recommended by our English teacher, so almost everyone in our class has read it already."},{"w":"think highly of","p":"adv.","d":"high · P 易混淆","c":"看重","s":"All the teachers think highly of Amy because she always helps her friends and never gives up on anything."}]},{"unit":14,"theme":"highly – inside","cards":[{"w":"highly possible","p":"adv.","d":"highly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很有可能","s":"It is highly possible that the game will be put off tomorrow because a big typhoon is coming to Taiwan."},{"w":"highly dangerous","p":"adv.","d":"highly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常危險","s":"Swimming in the river after heavy rain is highly dangerous, so the police told everyone to stay away from it."},{"w":"speak highly of","p":"adv.","d":"highly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"稱讚","s":"My parents speak highly of my new math teacher because she explains everything slowly and clearly to the class."},{"w":"go home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回家","s":"After basketball practice, Tom and I usually go home together and talk about the games we watched on TV."},{"w":"get home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到家","s":"My father often gets home very late on Fridays because there is a lot of traffic on the road from the city."},{"w":"stay home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"待在家","s":"When the typhoon comes this weekend, we will stay home, play cards, and watch some movies together."},{"w":"come home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回家來","s":"My sister will come home from Japan next week, and my mother plans to cook a big dinner for her."},{"w":"at home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在家；自在","s":"On rainy days, I like to stay at home, drink hot tea, and read a good book near the window."},{"w":"make yourself at home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"別客氣，當自己家","s":"Please come in, sit down, and make yourself at home; I will bring you some cookies and a cup of tea."},{"w":"homesick","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"想家","s":"During his first month at the new school in Taipei, Peter felt homesick and often called his family in Tainan."},{"w":"home-made","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"自製的","s":"My grandmother's home-made cookies are the best in the world, and she makes a big box of them every Sunday."},{"w":"feel at home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"感到自在","s":"Although Lisa moved to a new city only two months ago, she already feels at home with her new neighbors."},{"w":"on the way home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"回家路上","s":"On the way home from school, we often stop at the small store to buy a drink and some snacks."},{"w":"take sth. home","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"帶回家","s":"There was too much pizza at the party, so the host asked us to take some home for our families."},{"w":"hometown","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"故鄉","s":"My hometown is a small fishing village in the south, and we go back there every Chinese New Year."},{"w":"homework","p":"adv.","d":"home · A 延伸義／程度","c":"功課","s":"I have to finish my math homework before dinner because my favorite TV show starts at eight tonight."},{"w":"go home（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"home · P 易混淆","c":"home 當副詞不加介係詞","s":"It is dark and cold outside now, so let us go home and have some hot soup with Grandma together."},{"w":"stay at home","p":"adv.","d":"home · P 易混淆","c":"待在家（可加 at）","s":"My mother has a cold today, so she will stay at home and rest instead of going to the office."},{"w":"go to his home","p":"adv.","d":"home · P 易混淆","c":"去他家（名詞用法加 to）","s":"After class, we will go to his home to play video games, and his mother will make dumplings for us."},{"w":"However, I like it.","p":"adv.","d":"however · A 延伸義／程度","c":"然而，我喜歡。","s":"Many people say this movie is too long and boring. However, I like it because the music is wonderful."},{"w":"however hard you try","p":"adv.","d":"however · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不管你多努力","s":"However hard you try, you cannot finish all this homework in one hour, so start early tonight."},{"w":"however you like","p":"adv.","d":"however · A 延伸義／程度","c":"隨你喜歡","s":"You can cook the eggs however you like, but I want mine with a little salt and no pepper."},{"w":"however long it takes","p":"adv.","d":"however · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不管花多久","s":"However long it takes, I will keep practicing the piano until I can play this song without any mistakes."},{"w":"however（然而；逗號隔開）","p":"adv.","d":"however · P 易混淆","c":"however 後接逗號","s":"The test was really difficult for everyone. However, Jenny still got a perfect score and surprised the whole class."},{"w":"however 可放句中","p":"adv.","d":"however · P 易混淆","c":"…, however, …","s":"The weather was terrible on Saturday; the picnic, however, was still a lot of fun for the whole family."},{"w":"however 不可直接連接兩句","p":"adv.","d":"however · P 易混淆","c":"需用分號或句點","s":"Tom studied hard for the test. However, he still made some small mistakes because he did not sleep well."},{"w":"inside out","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"裡外顛倒","s":"My little brother was in a hurry this morning, so he put his T-shirt on inside out and went to school."},{"w":"go inside","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"進去","s":"It started to rain while we were playing basketball, so we had to go inside and finish the game another day."},{"w":"stay inside","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"留在室內","s":"The weather report says a typhoon will hit Taiwan tonight, so everyone should stay inside and keep safe."},{"w":"inside and out","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"裡裡外外","s":"Before the New Year, my family made the whole house clean inside and out, and we even washed all the windows."},{"w":"deep inside","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"內心深處","s":"Although Mike said he did not care about the game, deep inside he was very sad because his team lost."},{"w":"look inside","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"往裡面看","s":"The little girl was afraid to look inside the dark box, so her brother opened it and found a cute kitten."},{"w":"inside the box","p":"adv.","d":"inside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在盒子裡","s":"My grandmother keeps old photos and letters inside the box under her bed, and she looks at them sometimes."},{"w":"inside out（裡外反穿）","p":"adv.","d":"inside · P 易混淆","c":"inside out 指反面朝外","s":"Mary put on her sweater inside out, so we could see the white words on her back all morning."},{"w":"wear a shirt inside out","p":"adv.","d":"inside · P 易混淆","c":"襯衫穿反了","s":"When I got to school, my friend told me that I was wearing my shirt inside out, so I fixed it quickly."}]},{"unit":15,"theme":"instead – just","cards":[{"w":"Instead, he stayed home.","p":"adv.","d":"instead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"反而，他待在家。","s":"Tom did not want to go to the party with his friends on Friday. Instead, he stayed home and read a book."},{"w":"instead of","p":"adv.","d":"instead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"而不是","s":"On hot summer days, my mother makes us fruit juice instead of soda because it is much better for our health."},{"w":"go instead","p":"adv.","d":"instead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"代替去","s":"My father is too busy to pick me up today, so my uncle will go instead and take me to the dentist."},{"w":"instead of going out","p":"adv.","d":"instead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不出去，反而","s":"Instead of going out to eat at a restaurant, we cooked dinner at home and saved a lot of money."},{"w":"tea instead of coffee","p":"adv.","d":"instead · A 延伸義／程度","c":"以茶代替咖啡","s":"My grandfather drinks hot tea instead of coffee every morning because coffee makes his heart beat too fast."},{"w":"instead（放句首或句尾）","p":"adv.","d":"instead · P 易混淆","c":"instead 單用為副詞","s":"The store did not have the red shoes in my size, so I bought a pair of white ones instead."},{"w":"instead of + 名詞／V-ing","p":"adv.","d":"instead · P 易混淆","c":"instead of 接名詞或動名詞","s":"Instead of watching TV all afternoon, you should go outside and ride your bike with your friends in the park."},{"w":"Let's walk instead.","p":"adv.","d":"instead · P 易混淆","c":"我們改成走路吧。","s":"The bus will not come for another thirty minutes, so let's walk instead and enjoy the nice weather."},{"w":"Walk instead of driving.","p":"adv.","d":"instead · P 易混淆","c":"走路而不要開車。","s":"Walk instead of driving when the store is near your house, because it is good for your health and the air."},{"w":"just now","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"剛才","s":"Your mother called just now and asked you to buy some eggs and milk on your way home from school."},{"w":"just then","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在那時","s":"I was looking for my umbrella at the door, and just then it stopped raining and the sun came out."},{"w":"just in time","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"正好及時","s":"We ran to the station as fast as we could and got there just in time to catch the last train."},{"w":"just a minute","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"稍等一下","s":"Please wait here just a minute while I go upstairs and get my jacket, and then we can leave for the movie."},{"w":"just a little","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"只要一點點","s":"This soup needs just a little salt, so do not add too much, or it will taste too strong."},{"w":"just about","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"差不多","s":"I am just about finished with my science report, so give me five more minutes and then we can play."},{"w":"just like","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就像","s":"My little brother looks just like my father when he laughs, and everyone in the family says the same thing."},{"w":"just kidding","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"開玩笑的","s":"I told my sister that I ate all her chocolate, but then I laughed and said I was just kidding."},{"w":"just in case","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"以防萬一","s":"The sky is clear right now, but you should take an umbrella just in case it rains in the afternoon."},{"w":"just the same","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一樣","s":"I ordered the chicken and my friend ordered the fish, but the two dishes tasted just the same to me."},{"w":"just right","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"剛剛好","s":"The water in the bath is just right, not too hot and not too cold, so you can get in now."},{"w":"not just","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不只是","s":"Exercise is not just good for your body; it also helps you feel happy and sleep better at night."},{"w":"just because","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"只因為","s":"My brother bought the expensive shoes just because his favorite basketball player wears the same ones on TV."},{"w":"just as","p":"adv.","d":"just · A 延伸義／程度","c":"正如；正當","s":"Just as I was leaving the house for school, my mother called me back because I forgot my lunch box."},{"w":"just（剛剛；完成式）","p":"adv.","d":"just · P 易混淆","c":"just 常用於完成式","s":"I have just finished my homework, so now I can watch my favorite TV show with my little brother."},{"w":"just now（剛才；過去式）","p":"adv.","d":"just · P 易混淆","c":"just now 用於過去簡單式","s":"The teacher came into the room just now, so please be quiet and open your books to page ten."},{"w":"I have just eaten.","p":"adv.","d":"just · P 易混淆","c":"我剛吃過。","s":"I have just eaten a big bowl of beef noodles, so I do not want any cake right now, thank you."},{"w":"I ate just now.","p":"adv.","d":"just · P 易混淆","c":"我剛才吃的。","s":"I ate just now at the night market with my cousins, so I am too full to have dinner with you."},{"w":"just one more","p":"adv.","d":"just · P 易混淆","c":"只要再一個","s":"These cookies are so good that I want just one more, and then I promise I will stop eating them."}]},{"unit":16,"theme":"last – lately","cards":[{"w":"at last","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"終於","s":"After we waited for two long hours in the cold wind, the last bus to Taipei came at last."},{"w":"last night","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"昨晚","s":"Last night my family went to the night market, and we ate fried chicken and played some games there."},{"w":"last but not least","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最後但同樣重要","s":"I want to thank my teachers, my friends, and last but not least, my parents for helping me this year."},{"w":"the last thing I want","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我最不想要的","s":"The last thing I want on a rainy Monday morning is a big math test, but we have one at eight."},{"w":"last of all","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最後","s":"First we visited the temple, then we had lunch near the river, and last of all we went shopping downtown."},{"w":"last time","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"上次","s":"Last time we went to this restaurant, the service was slow, so let's try the new one across the street."},{"w":"at the last minute","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在最後一刻","s":"Jack always does his homework at the last minute, so he often makes mistakes and gets a low grade."},{"w":"the last person to","p":"adv.","d":"last · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最不可能…的人","s":"Amy is the last person to be late for school because she always gets up at six and leaves early."},{"w":"last（上一個；最後）","p":"adv.","d":"last · P 易混淆","c":"last 指緊接之前的","s":"I did not watch the last part of the show, so please do not tell me what happened in it."},{"w":"the last page","p":"adv.","d":"last · P 易混淆","c":"最後一頁","s":"You can find the answers to all the questions on the last page of the book, so check them yourself."},{"w":"last week","p":"adv.","d":"last · P 易混淆","c":"上週","s":"Last week we had three tests in two days, so everyone in my class was tired and went to bed early."},{"w":"stay up late","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"熬夜","s":"If you stay up late to play video games every night, you will feel tired and sleepy in class the next day."},{"w":"late at night","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"深夜","s":"My father often comes home late at night, so my mother keeps his dinner warm in the kitchen for him."},{"w":"sleep late","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"睡到很晚","s":"On Sunday mornings I like to sleep late, and then my mother makes a big breakfast for the whole family."},{"w":"run late","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"（進度）落後；快遲到","s":"Hurry up, we are running late, and the train to Taichung leaves in only fifteen minutes from now."},{"w":"work late","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"工作到很晚","s":"My mother had to work late at the office yesterday, so my father cooked dinner for my sister and me."},{"w":"late for school","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"上學遲到","s":"Tom was late for school again today because his alarm clock did not ring and he missed the first bus."},{"w":"better late than never","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遲做總比不做好","s":"Mark started learning to swim at the age of forty, and he always says better late than never."},{"w":"of late","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最近","s":"My grandmother has not been feeling well of late, so we visit her every weekend and bring her favorite fruit."},{"w":"in late May","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"五月下旬","s":"Our school trip to the beach will be in late May, when the weather is warm but not too hot."},{"w":"late in life","p":"adv.","d":"late · A 延伸義／程度","c":"晚年","s":"My grandfather started to paint late in life, but now his beautiful pictures hang on the walls of our living room."},{"w":"late（晚；遲）","p":"adv.","d":"late · P 易混淆","c":"late 副詞指時間晚","s":"The movie started late because of a problem with the lights, so we did not get home until eleven."},{"w":"lately（最近）","p":"adv.","d":"late · P 易混淆","c":"lately 指近來","s":"My cousin has been very busy lately, so she has not had time to come over and play with us."},{"w":"come home late","p":"adv.","d":"late · P 易混淆","c":"晚回家","s":"If you come home late again without calling, your parents will be very worried and maybe a little angry."},{"w":"I've been busy lately.","p":"adv.","d":"late · P 易混淆","c":"我最近很忙。","s":"I've been busy lately with homework and basketball practice, so I have not watched any movies this month."},{"w":"the late Mr. Wang","p":"adv.","d":"late · P 易混淆","c":"已故的王先生","s":"The school library is named after the late Mr. Wang, who taught English here for more than thirty years."},{"w":"What have you done lately?","p":"adv.","d":"lately · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你最近做了什麼？","s":"What have you done lately? I have not seen you at the basketball court for almost a month."},{"w":"lately 常與完成式連用","p":"adv.","d":"lately · A 延伸義／程度","c":"Have you seen him lately?","s":"Have you seen him lately? He has not come to class for a week, and I am worried about him."},{"w":"not lately","p":"adv.","d":"lately · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最近沒有","s":"I used to swim every morning before school, but not lately, because the weather has been too cold and rainy."},{"w":"only lately","p":"adv.","d":"lately · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直到最近才","s":"Only lately has my little brother started to enjoy reading, and now he takes a book with him everywhere."}]},{"unit":17,"theme":"later – left","cards":[{"w":"See you later.","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"待會見。","s":"I have to go to my piano lesson now, so see you later at the night market around seven."},{"w":"sooner or later","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遲早","s":"If you keep eating so much fast food and candy, sooner or later you will get sick and need a doctor."},{"w":"later on","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"之後","s":"We will have a short meeting at nine, and later on the teacher will take us to the science museum."},{"w":"two days later","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"兩天後","s":"Jack lost his dog in the park on Monday, and two days later a kind woman found it near the river."},{"w":"no later than","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不晚於","s":"Please hand in your book report no later than Friday morning, or the teacher will take ten points off your grade."},{"w":"later that day","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"那天稍晚","s":"We went to the zoo in the morning, and later that day we had a big dinner at my grandmother's house."},{"w":"Catch you later.","p":"adv.","d":"later · A 延伸義／程度","c":"晚點見。","s":"I have to run to catch my bus now, so catch you later at the baseball game this evening."},{"w":"later（之後；從過去某點）","p":"adv.","d":"later · P 易混淆","c":"later 接在時間長度後","s":"Tom moved to Taipei in 2020, and three years later he opened his own small coffee shop near the station."},{"w":"a week later","p":"adv.","d":"later · P 易混淆","c":"（那時起）一週後","s":"My family moved to Kaohsiung in March, and a week later my brother found a job at a big hotel there."},{"w":"at least","p":"adv.","d":"least · A 延伸義／程度","c":"至少","s":"The movie starts at seven, so we should leave home at least thirty minutes early to find good seats."},{"w":"at least once","p":"adv.","d":"least · A 延伸義／程度","c":"至少一次","s":"Everyone should try to visit the night market in Taipei at least once because the food there is wonderful."},{"w":"the least expensive","p":"adv.","d":"least · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最便宜的","s":"This small blue bag is the least expensive one in the store, but it still looks very nice."},{"w":"not in the least","p":"adv.","d":"least · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一點也不","s":"Mary was not in the least afraid of the big dog, and she even put some water in front of it."},{"w":"least of all","p":"adv.","d":"least · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最不…的是","s":"Nobody wanted to clean the kitchen after the party, least of all my lazy little brother Tom."},{"w":"to say the least","p":"adv.","d":"least · A 延伸義／程度","c":"至少可以這麼說","s":"The test was really hard, to say the least, and most students in our class could not finish it."},{"w":"at least（至少）","p":"adv.","d":"least · P 易混淆","c":"at least 表下限","s":"You need to drink at least eight glasses of water every day when the weather is this hot."},{"w":"at least ten","p":"adv.","d":"least · P 易混淆","c":"至少十個","s":"Our teacher asked us to read at least ten English books this summer and write about each one."},{"w":"the least（最少）","p":"adv.","d":"least · P 易混淆","c":"little 的最高級","s":"Among all the students in my class, Peter has the least homework because he always finishes it at school."},{"w":"turn left","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"左轉","s":"Walk down this street for five minutes and turn left at the bank, and you will see the post office."},{"w":"on the left","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在左邊","s":"In our room at school, the windows are on the left and the door is on the right near the teacher's desk."},{"w":"left over","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"剩下的","s":"There was a lot of food left over after the party, so Mom put it in the refrigerator for tomorrow."},{"w":"keep left","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"靠左","s":"When you ride your bike on this road, please keep left so the cars can pass you safely."},{"w":"left-handed","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"左撇子的","s":"My cousin is left-handed, so she always sits at the end of the table when we eat dinner together."},{"w":"the left side","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"左側","s":"The driver asked us to sit on the left side of the bus because we can see the sea from there."},{"w":"nothing left","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"什麼都不剩","s":"When I got to the bakery at six, there was nothing left because all the bread was sold out."},{"w":"two left","p":"adv.","d":"left · A 延伸義／程度","c":"剩兩個","s":"We bought a box of twelve cookies this morning, but now there are only two left for Dad."},{"w":"left（左邊；向左）","p":"adv.","d":"left · P 易混淆","c":"left 當方向","s":"Keep walking along the river and then go left at the big tree, and the park is right there."},{"w":"left（leave 的過去式）","p":"adv.","d":"left · P 易混淆","c":"left 當動詞是「離開了」","s":"My sister left for Japan last Monday, and she will stay there with our aunt for two weeks."},{"w":"He left early.","p":"adv.","d":"left · P 易混淆","c":"他提早離開了。","s":"Jack left early because he had a bad headache, so he did not finish the game with us."},{"w":"Turn left here.","p":"adv.","d":"left · P 易混淆","c":"在這左轉。","s":"Turn left here at the corner, and you will find the new ice cream shop next to the bookstore."},{"w":"only one left","p":"adv.","d":"left · P 易混淆","c":"只剩一個","s":"Hurry up and buy the ticket now, because there is only one left for the show this Saturday night."}]},{"unit":18,"theme":"less – loud","cards":[{"w":"more or less","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"差不多；或多或少","s":"The two houses are more or less the same size, but the one near the park costs much more."},{"w":"less than ten","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"少於十","s":"The new MRT station is close to my home, so it takes less than ten minutes to walk there."},{"w":"no less than","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多達","s":"No less than three hundred people came to the school fair, and they bought all the cookies in one hour."},{"w":"less and less","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"越來越少","s":"Grandpa reads less and less these days because his eyes get tired easily, so I read the news to him."},{"w":"much less","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更不用說","s":"Tom cannot even cook rice, much less make a big dinner for the whole family on his own."},{"w":"none the less","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"仍然","s":"It rained all day during our trip, but none the less we had a great time at the beach."},{"w":"eat less","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"少吃","s":"The doctor asked my father to eat less and walk more because he is a little heavy now."},{"w":"in less than a week","p":"adv.","d":"less · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不到一週","s":"Our new puppy learned to sit and come when we call in less than a week, which surprised everyone."},{"w":"less（較少；不可數）","p":"adv.","d":"less · P 易混淆","c":"less + 不可數名詞","s":"You should put less sugar in the tea because too much sugar is not good for your health."},{"w":"less water","p":"adv.","d":"less · P 易混淆","c":"較少水","s":"Please use less water when you wash the dishes, because the city does not have much rain this year."},{"w":"less + 形容詞","p":"adv.","d":"less · P 易混淆","c":"較不…","s":"This math problem is less difficult than the last one, so I think you can finish it alone."},{"w":"less important","p":"adv.","d":"less · P 易混淆","c":"較不重要","s":"Getting a high score is less important than learning something new, so do not worry about the test."},{"w":"so long","p":"adv.","d":"long · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再見","s":"It was fun to play basketball with you this afternoon, so long and see you at school tomorrow."},{"w":"long ago","p":"adv.","d":"long · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很久以前","s":"Long ago, there were no cars or buses in this town, and people walked everywhere or used horses."},{"w":"take long","p":"adv.","d":"long · A 延伸義／程度","c":"花很久","s":"It did not take long to cook the noodles, so dinner was ready before Dad came home from work."},{"w":"not long after","p":"adv.","d":"long · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不久之後","s":"Not long after we got to the park, it started to rain, and we had to run back home."},{"w":"long for","p":"adv.","d":"long · A 延伸義／程度","c":"渴望","s":"During the long hot summer, the kids long for a cold ice cream and a swim in the sea."},{"w":"at long last","p":"adv.","d":"long · A 延伸義／程度","c":"終於","s":"After waiting for almost two hours in the rain, the bus came at long last and we got on quickly."},{"w":"How long…?","p":"adv.","d":"long · C 句型","c":"…多久？","s":"How long does it take to get to the airport from here by bus on a Sunday morning?"},{"w":"How long have you been here?","p":"adv.","d":"long · C 句型","c":"你來這多久了？","s":"How long have you been here in Taiwan, and do you like the food and the hot weather?"},{"w":"as long as you want","p":"adv.","d":"long · C 句型","c":"只要你想","s":"You can stay at our house as long as you want, because my parents really enjoy talking with you."},{"w":"It won't take long.","p":"adv.","d":"long · C 句型","c":"不會花太久。","s":"Please wait here for a moment because it won't take long for the doctor to see your little brother."},{"w":"out loud","p":"adv.","d":"loud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大聲地（說出來）","s":"The teacher asked Lisa to read the poem out loud so that everyone in the class could hear it."},{"w":"read out loud","p":"adv.","d":"loud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大聲朗讀","s":"Every morning before school, I read out loud an English story for ten minutes to practice my speaking."},{"w":"laugh out loud","p":"adv.","d":"loud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"放聲大笑","s":"When my dad told that funny joke about the cat, we all began to laugh out loud at the dinner table."},{"w":"think out loud","p":"adv.","d":"loud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"邊想邊說","s":"Sorry, I was just thinking out loud about where to go for lunch, so you do not have to answer me."},{"w":"loud and clear","p":"adv.","d":"loud · A 延伸義／程度","c":"清楚明白","s":"The coach said loud and clear that anyone who comes late to practice will not play in Saturday's game."},{"w":"loud（大聲地；口語）","p":"adv.","d":"loud · P 易混淆","c":"loud 口語可當副詞","s":"Do not play your music so loud at night because the people living next door need to sleep."},{"w":"talk loud","p":"adv.","d":"loud · P 易混淆","c":"大聲講","s":"Grandpa cannot hear very well, so you have to talk loud when you want to tell him something."},{"w":"speak loudly","p":"adv.","d":"loud · P 易混淆","c":"大聲說","s":"The students in the back of the room could not hear, so the teacher asked Tom to speak loudly."}]},{"unit":19,"theme":"low – more","cards":[{"w":"lie low","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"保持低調","s":"After he broke the window with his ball, Peter decided to lie low for a few days at home."},{"w":"low in fat","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"低脂","s":"This fish is low in fat and full of good things, so my mother cooks it two times a week."},{"w":"run low on","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快用完","s":"We often run low on milk and eggs by Friday, so I stop by the store on my way home from school."},{"w":"feel low","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"心情低落","s":"Sandy felt low after she lost the singing game, so her friends took her out for some ice cream."},{"w":"keep the price low","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"壓低價格","s":"The shop keeps the price low on vegetables so that families with little money can still eat well."},{"w":"low on money","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"錢不夠","s":"I am a little low on money this month because I spent too much on comic books and snacks."},{"w":"speak low","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"低聲說","s":"The baby was sleeping in the next room, so we had to speak low while we watched the movie."},{"w":"fly low","p":"adv.","d":"low · A 延伸義／程度","c":"低飛","s":"Before the big rain, the birds fly low over the farms, and the farmers know the weather will change soon."},{"w":"low（低低地）","p":"adv.","d":"low · P 易混淆","c":"low 副詞指高度","s":"The sun hung low in the sky at six o'clock, and the whole beach turned a beautiful orange color."},{"w":"lowly（卑微的）","p":"adv.","d":"low · P 易混淆","c":"lowly 是形容詞，非副詞","s":"The old story is about a lowly farm boy who works hard and one day becomes the king's best friend."},{"w":"bow low","p":"adv.","d":"low · P 易混淆","c":"深深鞠躬","s":"At the end of the show, all the singers walked to the front of the stage and bowed low to the crowd."},{"w":"a low voice","p":"adv.","d":"low · P 易混淆","c":"低沉的聲音","s":"My father has a low voice, so when he reads stories at night, my little sister falls asleep quickly."},{"w":"Maybe later.","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · A 延伸義／程度","c":"或許晚點。","s":"I cannot help you with your math homework right now because I am busy cooking, so maybe later tonight."},{"w":"Maybe not.","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · A 延伸義／程度","c":"也許不。","s":"Do you think it will stop raining before the baseball game this afternoon, or maybe not?"},{"w":"Maybe so.","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · A 延伸義／程度","c":"也許是這樣。","s":"You say the new restaurant near the station is better than ours, and maybe so, but it costs too much."},{"w":"maybe someday","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · A 延伸義／程度","c":"或許有一天","s":"I do not have enough money to travel to Japan now, but maybe someday I will see the beautiful flowers there."},{"w":"Maybe you're right.","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · A 延伸義／程度","c":"或許你是對的。","s":"Maybe you're right about the weather, so let us bring an umbrella to the park just in case."},{"w":"maybe（也許；一字，副詞）","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · P 易混淆","c":"maybe 放句首","s":"Maybe we can go to the beach on Sunday if the weather is nice and Dad does not have to work."},{"w":"Maybe he is sick.","p":"adv.","d":"maybe · P 易混淆","c":"也許他病了。","s":"Maybe he is sick today, because he usually comes to school early and sits in the front row."},{"w":"more and more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"越來越","s":"More and more students ride a bike to school now because it is good for their health and the air."},{"w":"once more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再一次","s":"The song was so beautiful that everyone asked the band to play it once more before they went home."},{"w":"no more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不再；沒有更多","s":"There is no more rice in the kitchen, so we have to eat noodles for dinner tonight instead."},{"w":"more than","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"超過；不只","s":"More than five hundred people came to the night market on Saturday to try the famous fried chicken."},{"w":"what's more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"而且","s":"This phone takes great pictures, and what's more, it costs much less than the one I saw yesterday."},{"w":"the more…the more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"越…越…","s":"The more Jenny practices the piano after school, the more beautiful her music sounds to the family."},{"w":"more than happy to","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常樂意","s":"My aunt is more than happy to drive us to the museum because she loves art and old things too."},{"w":"any more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再多一點","s":"Do you want any more tea or cake before we leave, because there is still a lot on the table?"},{"w":"some more","p":"adv.","d":"more · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再多一些","s":"The soup is really good tonight, Mom, so could I please have some more before my brother finishes it all?"},{"w":"more + 多音節形容詞","p":"adv.","d":"more · C 句型","c":"more 構成比較級","s":"For me, English is more interesting than math because I can use it to talk with people from other countries."},{"w":"more beautiful than","p":"adv.","d":"more · C 句型","c":"比…更美","s":"Many people think the flowers in spring are more beautiful than the red leaves we see in the fall."},{"w":"the more…, the more…","p":"adv.","d":"more · C 句型","c":"越…越…","s":"The more my little brother plays video games at night, the more tired he looks in class the next morning."},{"w":"The more you read, the more you know.","p":"adv.","d":"more · C 句型","c":"讀得越多，知道越多。","s":"The more you read, the more you know, so our teacher gives us a new book every month."},{"w":"more than ten","p":"adv.","d":"more · C 句型","c":"超過十個","s":"More than ten students in our class joined the school basketball team this year, which made the coach very happy."},{"w":"not more than","p":"adv.","d":"more · C 句型","c":"不超過","s":"Students may bring not more than two snacks on the school trip, so choose your favorite ones carefully."}]},{"unit":20,"theme":"most – much","cards":[{"w":"most of all","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最重要的是","s":"I love my new school for many reasons, but most of all I love the kind teachers and friendly students."},{"w":"at most","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最多","s":"The trip from my house to the train station takes at most fifteen minutes if I walk fast."},{"w":"make the most of","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"善用","s":"We only have three days in Japan, so let us make the most of our time and visit the famous places early."},{"w":"for the most part","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大部分來說","s":"For the most part, the students in my class like the new English teacher because she makes lessons fun."},{"w":"most of the time","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大部分時間","s":"My grandfather spends most of the time in his garden, where he grows tomatoes and talks to his birds."},{"w":"the most important","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最重要的","s":"The most important thing before a test is to get enough sleep, not to study all night long."},{"w":"most people","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大部分人","s":"Most people in Taiwan drink tea every day, and many of them like it with milk and ice."},{"w":"most of them","p":"adv.","d":"most · A 延伸義／程度","c":"他們大多數","s":"I have many friends in this class, and most of them live near the school and walk there together."},{"w":"most（大部分；最）","p":"adv.","d":"most · P 易混淆","c":"most 當形容詞或最高級","s":"Most kids in my town love the summer because they can swim in the river and eat ice cream."},{"w":"mostly（主要地；多半）","p":"adv.","d":"most · P 易混淆","c":"mostly 是副詞","s":"The people at the party were mostly my mother's friends from work, so I did not know many of them."},{"w":"most students","p":"adv.","d":"most · P 易混淆","c":"大部分學生","s":"Most students in our school take the bus home, but a few of them ride a bike or walk with friends."},{"w":"the most expensive","p":"adv.","d":"most · P 易混淆","c":"最貴的","s":"That red watch in the window is the most expensive one in the shop, so I can only look at it."},{"w":"Students here are mostly from Taipei.","p":"adv.","d":"most · P 易混淆","c":"這裡的學生多半來自台北。","s":"Students here are mostly from Taipei, but some of them come from small towns in the south and live at school."},{"w":"mostly sunny","p":"adv.","d":"mostly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大多晴天","s":"The weather report says it will be mostly sunny this weekend, so we can finally have our picnic by the lake."},{"w":"mostly students","p":"adv.","d":"mostly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多半是學生","s":"The people waiting outside the bookstore at nine were mostly students who wanted to buy the new comic book."},{"w":"I mostly stay home.","p":"adv.","d":"mostly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我多半待在家。","s":"On rainy Sundays I mostly stay home and read or watch movies with my family in the living room."},{"w":"mostly because","p":"adv.","d":"mostly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"主要是因為","s":"I did not join the school trip to the mountain, mostly because I had a bad cold that week."},{"w":"very much","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常","s":"Thank you very much for helping me carry these heavy books all the way to the library this morning."},{"w":"too much","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太多","s":"My sister puts too much salt in her soup, so nobody at the table wants to try it again."},{"w":"so much","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"這麼多","s":"There is so much homework to do tonight that I cannot go to the movies with you after dinner."},{"w":"how much","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多少（錢／量）","s":"How much is this blue jacket, and do you have a bigger size for my tall older brother?"},{"w":"not much","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不多","s":"There is not much milk left in the bottle, so please buy some on your way home from work."},{"w":"much better","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好很多","s":"I feel much better today after sleeping for ten hours, so I can go back to school tomorrow."},{"w":"much too hot","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"實在太熱","s":"It is much too hot to play basketball outside at noon, so let us wait until five o'clock."},{"w":"as much as","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"和…一樣多","s":"My little brother can eat as much as my father at dinner, but he is still very thin."},{"w":"much the same","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大致相同","s":"The two restaurants are much the same, but the one near the park has more kinds of ice cream."},{"w":"much more","p":"adv.","d":"much · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更多；更加","s":"Mary enjoys reading much more than watching TV, so she visits the library almost every afternoon after school."},{"w":"much + 比較級","p":"adv.","d":"much · C 句型","c":"much 加強比較級","s":"This new bike is much faster than my old one, so now I get to school in ten minutes."},{"w":"much taller than","p":"adv.","d":"much · C 句型","c":"高很多","s":"Tom is much taller than his older sister now, so he has to stand in the back row for photos."},{"w":"much + 不可數名詞","p":"adv.","d":"much · C 句型","c":"much 接不可數","s":"We did not have much rain this summer, so the farmers are worried about their rice and fruit trees."},{"w":"much time","p":"adv.","d":"much · C 句型","c":"很多時間","s":"Doing all this homework takes much time, so I cannot play basketball with my friends after school today."},{"w":"too much homework","p":"adv.","d":"much · C 句型","c":"太多功課","s":"Our teacher gave us too much homework for the weekend, so I cannot visit my grandmother on Sunday."}]},{"unit":21,"theme":"near – neither","cards":[{"w":"near here","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"這附近","s":"Is there a post office near here, because I need to send this birthday card to my friend in Japan?"},{"w":"come near","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"靠近","s":"The little cat came near when it smelled the fish, but it ran away when my dog barked."},{"w":"near the end","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"接近尾聲","s":"The movie was boring at first, but near the end there was a big surprise that made everyone cry."},{"w":"in the near future","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在不久的將來","s":"In the near future, students may use computers for all their tests instead of paper and pencils."},{"w":"nowhere near","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遠遠不及","s":"My drawing of the dog is nowhere near as good as Amy's because she takes art lessons every week."},{"w":"near and far","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遠近各處","s":"People came from near and far to see the beautiful lanterns in the sky on the night of the festival."},{"w":"near at hand","p":"adv.","d":"near · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在手邊","s":"I always keep a pencil and some paper near at hand because good ideas often come when I am eating."},{"w":"near（接近；距離）","p":"adv.","d":"near · P 易混淆","c":"near 指位置或時間近","s":"Our new house is near the MRT station, so my father can get to work in only twenty minutes."},{"w":"nearly（幾乎）","p":"adv.","d":"near · P 易混淆","c":"nearly 指程度","s":"I nearly missed the school bus this morning because I could not find my shoes under the bed."},{"w":"live near the school","p":"adv.","d":"near · P 易混淆","c":"住在學校附近","s":"Lucy lives near the school, so she can walk home for lunch and come back before the bell rings."},{"w":"nearly finished","p":"adv.","d":"near · P 易混淆","c":"幾乎完成","s":"My science homework is nearly finished, so I can watch the baseball game with Dad in a few minutes."},{"w":"near（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"near · P 易混淆","c":"near 本身是介係詞","s":"The new bakery is near my school, so my friends and I often buy bread there after class."},{"w":"nearly every day","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎每天","s":"My grandfather goes to the park nearly every day to walk his dog and talk with his old friends."},{"w":"nearly ten o'clock","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快十點了","s":"It is nearly ten o'clock, so you should finish your homework quickly and get ready for bed now."},{"w":"nearly fell","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"差點跌倒","s":"Be careful on the wet floor because I nearly fell down this morning when I ran into the kitchen."},{"w":"nearly all","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎全部","s":"Nearly all the students in our class passed the English test, and the teacher brought us cookies to celebrate."},{"w":"not nearly enough","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遠遠不夠","s":"One bottle of water is not nearly enough for a long hike in the mountains on a hot summer day."},{"w":"not nearly（遠遠不）","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · P 易混淆","c":"not nearly 表差很多","s":"My brother is not nearly as tall as my father, but he still hopes to play basketball for the school."},{"w":"nearly new","p":"adv.","d":"nearly · P 易混淆","c":"幾乎全新","s":"My cousin gave me his old phone, and it is nearly new because he only used it for two months."},{"w":"Me neither.","p":"adv.","d":"neither · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我也不。","s":"Amy said she does not like ghost movies, and I told her me neither, so we watched a funny one instead."},{"w":"Neither do I.","p":"adv.","d":"neither · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我也不。","s":"My brother does not want to go to the night market tonight, and neither do I because it is too hot."},{"w":"neither of them","p":"adv.","d":"neither · A 延伸義／程度","c":"他們兩個都不","s":"I asked Tom and Peter about the party, but neither of them knew what time it would start on Saturday."},{"w":"neither here nor there","p":"adv.","d":"neither · A 延伸義／程度","c":"無關緊要","s":"Whether you wear the red shirt or the blue one is neither here nor there, because nobody will notice at the picnic."},{"w":"neither…nor","p":"adv.","d":"neither · A 延伸義／程度","c":"既不…也不","s":"The small restaurant near our school is neither cheap nor clean, so my friends and I never eat there."},{"w":"Neither + 助動詞 + 主詞","p":"adv.","d":"neither · C 句型","c":"「也不」倒裝句型","s":"My father never eats fast food, and neither does my mother, so we always cook dinner together at home."},{"w":"Neither can I.","p":"adv.","d":"neither · C 句型","c":"我也不會。","s":"Lisa cannot swim very well, and neither can I, so we both stayed on the beach and played in the sand."},{"w":"Neither did she.","p":"adv.","d":"neither · C 句型","c":"她也沒有。","s":"I did not finish the math homework last night because it was so hard, and neither did she."},{"w":"neither…nor 動詞看靠近者","p":"adv.","d":"neither · C 句型","c":"就近原則","s":"Neither the students nor the teacher knows the answer to this question, so we will look it up in the library."},{"w":"Neither he nor I am wrong.","p":"adv.","d":"neither · C 句型","c":"他和我都沒錯。","s":"Neither he nor I am wrong about the time of the game, because the coach changed it twice this week."}]},{"unit":22,"theme":"never – no","cards":[{"w":"never mind","p":"adv.","d":"never · A 延伸義／程度","c":"別介意","s":"Never mind about the cup you dropped, because it was old and I can buy a new one at the store."},{"w":"never ever","p":"adv.","d":"never · A 延伸義／程度","c":"絕對不","s":"I will never ever ride that terrible fast train at the park again, even if you give me free tickets."},{"w":"Never say never.","p":"adv.","d":"never · A 延伸義／程度","c":"永不說不可能。","s":"Never say never, because my grandmother started to learn English at seventy and now she reads stories in English."},{"w":"never too late","p":"adv.","d":"never · A 延伸義／程度","c":"永遠不嫌晚","s":"It is never too late to learn to swim, so my father joined a class at the pool last month."},{"w":"You never know.","p":"adv.","d":"never · A 延伸義／程度","c":"誰知道呢。","s":"You never know, maybe your favorite singer will come to our school festival this year and sing for us."},{"w":"never 放一般動詞前","p":"adv.","d":"never · C 句型","c":"never + 動詞","s":"My mother never drinks coffee after six in the evening because it makes it hard for her to sleep."},{"w":"never 放 be 動詞後","p":"adv.","d":"never · C 句型","c":"be + never","s":"The food in this restaurant is never cold when it comes to the table, so we eat here every Friday."},{"w":"I never eat breakfast.","p":"adv.","d":"never · C 句型","c":"我從不吃早餐。","s":"I never eat breakfast at home on school days because I always get up late and have to run to school."},{"w":"He is never late.","p":"adv.","d":"never · C 句型","c":"他從不遲到。","s":"Our math teacher is never late for class, and he always comes in with a big smile and a cup of tea."},{"w":"Never give up!","p":"adv.","d":"never · C 句型","c":"永不放棄！","s":"Never give up, even when the game looks lost, because our team won last year in the last two minutes."},{"w":"never 不與 not 連用","p":"adv.","d":"never · C 句型","c":"never 本身是否定","s":"Jack never comes to practice on time, and the coach is not happy about it, so Jack may not play on Sunday."},{"w":"next to","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在…旁邊","s":"The new bakery is next to the bank on Green Street, and it sells very good egg cakes and bread."},{"w":"next time","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下次","s":"I did not have time to visit the museum today, but next time I come to Taipei, I will go there first."},{"w":"next door","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"隔壁","s":"The old man who lives next door grows beautiful flowers in his garden and gives some to my mother every spring."},{"w":"the next day","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"第二天","s":"We arrived in Tainan late at night, and the next day we got up early to eat the famous breakfast there."},{"w":"next week","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下週","s":"There is a big English test next week, so I plan to study with my friends at the library every night."},{"w":"what next?","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"接下來呢？","s":"We have finished at the market and had lunch there, so what next, a movie or a walk in the park?"},{"w":"next to nothing","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎沒有","s":"My little brother knows next to nothing about cooking, but he still wants to make dinner for Mom's birthday."},{"w":"next in line","p":"adv.","d":"next · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下一位","s":"Please wait on the chair outside the office, because you are next in line to see the school nurse."},{"w":"next（下一個；從現在）","p":"adv.","d":"next · P 易混淆","c":"next 以現在為準","s":"We are going to Japan next summer, so I am studying a little Japanese every day after school this year."},{"w":"the next（接著的；從過去）","p":"adv.","d":"next · P 易混淆","c":"the next 以過去某點為準","s":"My aunt came to stay with us in June, and the next month she found a job near our house."},{"w":"next Monday","p":"adv.","d":"next · P 易混淆","c":"下週一","s":"The school basketball game is next Monday, so our team will practice every afternoon this week after class."},{"w":"the next Monday","p":"adv.","d":"next · P 易混淆","c":"（那時起）接下來的週一","s":"Peter moved to Taipei in the spring, and the next Monday he started school and made two new friends."},{"w":"no way","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不可能；絕不","s":"No way am I going to eat that strange green soup, because it smells like old fish and dirty socks."},{"w":"no doubt","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"無疑","s":"No doubt Jenny will win the singing game again this year, because she practices two hours every day."},{"w":"no wonder","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"難怪","s":"You ate three bowls of noodles and two pieces of cake at lunch, so no wonder you feel so full."},{"w":"no problem","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"沒問題","s":"No problem, I can help you carry the boxes to your new apartment on Saturday because I am free all day."},{"w":"No kidding!","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不是開玩笑吧！","s":"No kidding! You really met the famous baseball player at the night market and he signed your cap?"},{"w":"No matter what","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不管怎樣","s":"No matter what happens in the game tomorrow, our class will cheer for the team from the start to the end."},{"w":"say no to","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"拒絕","s":"It is hard to say no to a second piece of chocolate cake, but I am trying to eat healthy food this month."},{"w":"no more than","p":"adv.","d":"no · A 延伸義／程度","c":"只有；不過","s":"The walk from the train station to my school takes no more than ten minutes, so I never need the bus."},{"w":"no + 比較級","p":"adv.","d":"no · C 句型","c":"no 否定比較級","s":"This new phone is no cheaper than the old one, so I will keep using mine until it stops working."},{"w":"no better than","p":"adv.","d":"no · C 句型","c":"不比…好","s":"My cooking is no better than my brother's, so our parents still make dinner for us every night."},{"w":"no sooner…than…","p":"adv.","d":"no · C 句型","c":"一…就…","s":"No sooner had we sat down for the picnic than it started to rain, so we ran back to the car."},{"w":"There is no + V-ing.","p":"adv.","d":"no · C 句型","c":"不可能…","s":"There is no telling what the weather will be like on Sunday, so bring a jacket and an umbrella just in case."},{"w":"no + 名詞","p":"adv.","d":"no · C 句型","c":"沒有…","s":"There is no milk in the refrigerator this morning, so we have to drink juice with our bread."},{"w":"No smoking.","p":"adv.","d":"no · C 句型","c":"禁止吸菸。","s":"The sign on the wall says No smoking, so my uncle had to go outside to the street to smoke."}]},{"unit":23,"theme":"now – off","cards":[{"w":"right now","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"現在立刻","s":"The typhoon is coming, so Dad asked us to close all the windows right now before the strong wind arrives."},{"w":"now and then","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"偶爾","s":"My grandmother lives in Tainan, and we take the train to visit her now and then on long weekends."},{"w":"from now on","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從現在起","s":"After I failed the math test, I promised my mother that I would study harder from now on."},{"w":"by now","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到現在","s":"The movie started an hour ago, so by now Tom and his friends should already be in their seats in the theater."},{"w":"up to now","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到目前為止","s":"Up to now, our basketball team has won every game this season, and we are very proud of that."},{"w":"for now","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"目前；暫時","s":"We do not have enough money for a new sofa, so for now we will keep using the old one."},{"w":"now that","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"既然","s":"Now that the rain has stopped, let's go to the park and play badminton before dinner."},{"w":"Now what?","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"現在怎麼辦？","s":"We missed the last bus home, and my little brother looked at me and asked, Now what?"},{"w":"any day now","p":"adv.","d":"now · A 延伸義／程度","c":"隨時；就在這幾天","s":"The mangoes on the tree are almost yellow, so Grandpa says we can pick them any day now."},{"w":"now（現在）","p":"adv.","d":"now · P 易混淆","c":"now 用於現在式","s":"Mary is studying English in her room now, so please do not play the drum so loudly."},{"w":"just now（剛才）","p":"adv.","d":"now · P 易混淆","c":"just now 用於過去式","s":"Just now I met our teacher in the supermarket, and she was buying a lot of apples and milk."},{"w":"right now（馬上）","p":"adv.","d":"now · P 易混淆","c":"right now 強調立刻","s":"The soup is boiling over on the stove, so turn off the fire right now before it makes the kitchen dirty."},{"w":"now that + 子句（既然）","p":"adv.","d":"now · P 易混淆","c":"now that 是連接詞","s":"Now that you have finished all your homework, you may watch TV for half an hour before bed."},{"w":"day off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"休假日","s":"Friday is my mother's day off, so she usually takes us to the night market for dinner."},{"w":"take off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"起飛；脫掉；請假","s":"Our plane will take off at nine, so we have to arrive at the airport before seven in the morning."},{"w":"turn off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"關掉","s":"Please turn off the lights and the air conditioner when you leave the room to save energy."},{"w":"put off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"延期","s":"Because of the heavy rain, the school decided to put off the sports day until next Wednesday."},{"w":"get off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下車","s":"You should get off the bus at the next stop, and then the library is right across the street."},{"w":"show off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"炫耀","s":"Jack likes to show off his new cellphone to everyone, but nobody in our class really cares."},{"w":"call off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"取消","s":"The teacher had to call off the picnic because a strong typhoon was coming to Taiwan that weekend."},{"w":"go off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"響起；（食物）變壞","s":"My alarm clock did not go off this morning, so I was late for school for the first time."},{"w":"set off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"出發","s":"We will set off for the mountains at six tomorrow morning, so please go to bed early tonight."},{"w":"be off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"離開；休假","s":"It is already ten o'clock, and I must be off now because my mother is waiting for me outside."},{"w":"off and on","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"斷斷續續","s":"It rained off and on all afternoon, so we stayed inside and played cards with our cousins."},{"w":"see sb. off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"送行","s":"My uncle is moving to Japan for work, so the whole family drove to the airport to see him off."},{"w":"off duty","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下班","s":"My father is a police officer, and when he is off duty, he likes to go fishing by the river."},{"w":"10% off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"打九折","s":"This jacket is 10% off this week, so I think I will buy it before the sale ends on Sunday."},{"w":"far off","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"遙遠的","s":"Summer vacation seems far off when you are taking exams, but it will be here before you know it."},{"w":"keep off the grass","p":"adv.","d":"off · A 延伸義／程度","c":"勿踐踏草坪","s":"The sign in the park says keep off the grass, so we played frisbee on the basketball court instead."}]},{"unit":24,"theme":"often – only","cards":[{"w":"how often","p":"adv.","d":"often · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多常","s":"How often do you go to the library after school, and what kind of books do you usually borrow?"},{"w":"every so often","p":"adv.","d":"often · A 延伸義／程度","c":"偶爾","s":"My grandfather does not use the internet much, but every so often he sends us a short email."},{"w":"more often than not","p":"adv.","d":"often · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多半","s":"More often than not, my little sister falls asleep on the sofa before the movie is even half over."},{"w":"as often as possible","p":"adv.","d":"often · A 延伸義／程度","c":"盡量多次","s":"The doctor asked my father to walk as often as possible because he sits in the office all day."},{"w":"quite often","p":"adv.","d":"often · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當常","s":"We eat at the noodle shop near the school quite often because the food is cheap and delicious."},{"w":"not often","p":"adv.","d":"often · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不常","s":"It does not often snow in Taiwan, so many people drive up the mountains when it finally does."},{"w":"How often do you…?","p":"adv.","d":"often · C 句型","c":"你多常…？","s":"How often do you call your grandfather, and does he still remember all of your friends' names?"},{"w":"How often do you exercise?","p":"adv.","d":"often · C 句型","c":"你多常運動？","s":"How often do you exercise every week, and do you like to run outside or swim in the pool more?"},{"w":"often 放一般動詞前","p":"adv.","d":"often · C 句型","c":"often + 動詞","s":"Our class often plays basketball after school, and we sometimes stay at the playground until dark."},{"w":"often 放 be 動詞後","p":"adv.","d":"often · C 句型","c":"be + often","s":"The buses are often late during rush hour, so I leave home twenty minutes early on school days."},{"w":"at once","p":"adv.","d":"once · A 延伸義／程度","c":"馬上；同時","s":"When the teacher noticed the smoke in the kitchen, she asked all the students to leave the building at once."},{"w":"once upon a time","p":"adv.","d":"once · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很久很久以前","s":"Once upon a time, a kind farmer lived with his three daughters in a small village near the sea."},{"w":"once in a while","p":"adv.","d":"once · A 延伸義／程度","c":"偶爾","s":"My family likes to eat at home, but once in a while we go to a nice restaurant to celebrate."},{"w":"once and for all","p":"adv.","d":"once · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一次解決；徹底","s":"Let's clean out the garage once and for all this weekend so we never have to look at all that trash again."},{"w":"for once","p":"adv.","d":"once · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就這一次","s":"My brother always chooses the movie, so for once I would like to pick the one we watch tonight."},{"w":"once + 子句（一旦）","p":"adv.","d":"once · C 句型","c":"once 當連接詞","s":"Once you learn how to ride a bicycle, you will never forget it, even after many years."},{"w":"Once you start, don't stop.","p":"adv.","d":"once · C 句型","c":"一旦開始就別停。","s":"Once you start reading this comic book, do not stop, because the story gets more exciting with every page."},{"w":"once（曾經）","p":"adv.","d":"once · C 句型","c":"once 表過去一次","s":"My grandfather once worked as a sailor, and he still tells us exciting stories about the ocean."},{"w":"He once lived here.","p":"adv.","d":"once · C 句型","c":"他曾住這裡。","s":"Mr. Lin once lived in this old house by the river before he moved to Taipei for a new job."},{"w":"once or twice","p":"adv.","d":"once · C 句型","c":"一兩次","s":"I have only been to the new department store once or twice, so I do not know where the bookstore is."},{"w":"only child","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"獨生子女","s":"Amy is an only child, so she often invites her cousins over to play because the house feels quiet."},{"w":"if only","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"要是…就好了","s":"If only I had studied harder last night, I would not feel so nervous about the English test now."},{"w":"only too happy","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常樂意","s":"When my neighbor asked me to walk her dog, I said I would be only too happy to help her."},{"w":"only just","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"剛好；勉強","s":"The bus arrived just as I reached the stop, so I only just caught it and did not have to wait."},{"w":"the only way","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"唯一的方法","s":"The only way to get a good grade in science is to review your notes a little bit every day."},{"w":"only yesterday","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在昨天","s":"It was only yesterday that I lent you my dictionary, so how could you lose it so quickly?"},{"w":"for kids only","p":"adv.","d":"only · A 延伸義／程度","c":"僅限小孩","s":"This small swimming pool at the park is for kids only, so adults have to use the big one next to it."},{"w":"Only + 副詞子句 + 倒裝","p":"adv.","d":"only · C 句型","c":"only 置句首要倒裝","s":"Only after the teacher explained the question twice did the whole class understand how to solve it."},{"w":"Only then did I understand.","p":"adv.","d":"only · C 句型","c":"直到那時我才明白。","s":"Only then did I understand why my mother wanted me to bring an umbrella to school that morning."},{"w":"Only when it rains do we stay home.","p":"adv.","d":"only · C 句型","c":"只有下雨時我們才待在家。","s":"Only when it rains do we stay home on Sunday; on sunny days we always ride our bicycles to the river."},{"w":"Not only…but also + 倒裝","p":"adv.","d":"only · C 句型","c":"not only 置句首要倒裝","s":"Not only did Tom win the race, but he also helped a runner who fell down near the finish line."},{"w":"Not only is he smart, but he is also kind.","p":"adv.","d":"only · C 句型","c":"他不但聰明，也很善良。","s":"Not only is my sister smart, but she is also kind to everyone, so all the teachers like her a lot."},{"w":"only + 修飾位置改變意思","p":"adv.","d":"only · C 句型","c":"only 位置影響句意","s":"I only ate one cookie, but my brother only ate cookies, so he had no room for dinner at all."}]},{"unit":25,"theme":"out – outside","cards":[{"w":"watch out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"小心","s":"Watch out for the cars when you cross the street, because the drivers here do not always stop."},{"w":"find out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"找出；查明","s":"I want to find out who left this beautiful birthday card on my desk this morning before class."},{"w":"figure out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"想出；理解","s":"It took me an hour to figure out this math problem, but I felt great when I finally got the answer."},{"w":"run out of","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"用完","s":"We ran out of milk this morning, so I had to eat my cereal with juice, and it tasted terrible."},{"w":"turn out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"結果是","s":"Everyone was afraid of the big dog next door, but it turned out to be very friendly and gentle."},{"w":"eat out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"外食","s":"My parents are both too tired to cook on Fridays, so our family usually eats out at a noodle shop."},{"w":"work out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"運動；解決","s":"My father works out at the gym three times a week, and he says it helps him sleep much more deeply."},{"w":"give out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"分發；用完","s":"Our teacher gave out the test papers and asked us to write our names before we started."},{"w":"hand out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"分發","s":"At the school gate, two students were handing out papers about the music club to everyone who walked by."},{"w":"point out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"指出","s":"The teacher pointed out two mistakes in my sentence, and I corrected them before I handed in the paper."},{"w":"try out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"試用","s":"You can try out these new sports shoes for free this weekend before you decide to buy them."},{"w":"look out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"小心","s":"Look out, the floor is wet, and you might fall down if you run across the kitchen like that."},{"w":"sold out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"賣完","s":"The tickets for the Friday night show were sold out in only ten minutes, so we have to wait for the next one."},{"w":"go out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"外出；熄滅","s":"All the lights in the building suddenly went out during the storm, so we used some candles and waited."},{"w":"put out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"撲滅","s":"Many brave men and women worked all night to put out the fire in the old factory near the train station."},{"w":"pick out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"挑選","s":"It took my sister an hour to pick out a dress for the wedding because she liked every one in the shop."},{"w":"carry out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"執行","s":"The students will carry out a science project about plants, and they must water them every morning."},{"w":"check out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"結帳；看看","s":"Before you check out at the supermarket, make sure you did not forget the eggs and the butter."},{"w":"break out","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"爆發","s":"A fire broke out in the kitchen of the restaurant last night, but luckily nobody was hurt at all."},{"w":"out of order","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"故障","s":"The drink machine at our school is out of order again, so we had to buy water at the store across the street."},{"w":"out of date","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"過時","s":"This map is out of date because the new MRT station is not on it, so let's download a newer one."},{"w":"out of work","p":"adv.","d":"out · A 延伸義／程度","c":"失業","s":"My uncle has been out of work since the factory closed, so he is looking for a new job in Taipei."},{"w":"go outside","p":"adv.","d":"outside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到外面","s":"The weather is so nice today, so let's go outside and fly our kites in the park near the river."},{"w":"wait outside","p":"adv.","d":"outside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在外面等","s":"The doctor is still busy with another patient, so please wait outside until the nurse calls your name."},{"w":"outside of class","p":"adv.","d":"outside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"課堂以外","s":"Our English teacher wants us to read a short story in English outside of class every week."},{"w":"from the outside","p":"adv.","d":"outside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從外面看","s":"From the outside, the old house looks dark and strange, but inside it is warm and full of books."},{"w":"outside the box","p":"adv.","d":"outside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"跳脫框架","s":"Our teacher asked us to think outside the box, so our group made a robot out of old paper boxes."},{"w":"play outside","p":"adv.","d":"outside · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在外面玩","s":"The kids love to play outside after dinner, and they come home only when the sky gets dark."},{"w":"outside（在外面；不加 of）","p":"adv.","d":"outside · P 易混淆","c":"outside 直接接名詞","s":"My bicycle is right outside the school gate, so we can ride together to the night market after class."},{"w":"outside of（在…之外；口語）","p":"adv.","d":"outside · P 易混淆","c":"outside of 多指範圍","s":"Outside of my family and two close friends, nobody knows that I want to be a singer one day."}]},{"unit":26,"theme":"over – perhaps","cards":[{"w":"over and over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一再地","s":"My little brother watched the same cartoon over and over until he could sing every song in it."},{"w":"all over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到處；結束","s":"After the party, there were cups and paper plates all over the living room, so we had to clean for an hour."},{"w":"be over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"結束","s":"When the game was over, both teams shook hands and thanked the coaches for a wonderful season."},{"w":"come over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"過來","s":"Why don't you come over to my house after school, and we can do our homework together and eat pizza?"},{"w":"get over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"克服；痊癒","s":"It took my grandmother two weeks to get over her cold, and now she is finally strong enough to go out again."},{"w":"take over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"接管","s":"When our coach was sick last week, the PE teacher had to take over the basketball practice for a few days."},{"w":"think it over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"仔細考慮","s":"Joining the school band will take a lot of time, so please think it over carefully before you decide."},{"w":"turn over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"翻面","s":"Turn the fish over after three minutes so that both sides are golden brown and cooked well."},{"w":"hand over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"交出","s":"The teacher asked Jack to hand over his cellphone because he was playing games during the English lesson."},{"w":"go over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"複習；檢查","s":"Let's go over the new words one more time before the quiz, because some of them are hard to spell."},{"w":"over there","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在那邊","s":"The bookstore is over there, next to the bakery with the big red sign, so you cannot miss it."},{"w":"over the phone","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"透過電話","s":"My aunt lives in America, so we usually talk over the phone on Sunday nights instead of meeting."},{"w":"over the weekend","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"週末期間","s":"Over the weekend, my family painted the living room yellow, and now it looks bright and new."},{"w":"over ten","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"超過十","s":"There were over ten kinds of fruit at the market, but my grandmother only wanted to buy guavas."},{"w":"sleep over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在別人家過夜","s":"My best friend will sleep over at my house on Friday, so we can watch movies and talk all night."},{"w":"run over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"輾過","s":"The driver was going too fast and almost ran over a cat that was crossing the quiet street."},{"w":"pull over","p":"adv.","d":"over · A 延伸義／程度","c":"（車）停到路邊","s":"The police officer asked my father to pull over because one of the lights on our car was not working."},{"w":"study overseas","p":"adv.","d":"overseas · A 延伸義／程度","c":"留學","s":"My cousin wants to study overseas after high school, so she practices English every single day."},{"w":"overseas students","p":"adv.","d":"overseas · A 延伸義／程度","c":"外國留學生","s":"There are many overseas students in my uncle's university, and some of them come from Japan and Korea."},{"w":"an overseas trip","p":"adv.","d":"overseas · A 延伸義／程度","c":"海外旅行","s":"This summer my family is making plans for an overseas trip to Japan, and I am so excited about riding the fast trains."},{"w":"work overseas","p":"adv.","d":"overseas · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在國外工作","s":"My father has to work overseas for six months, so we talk to him on the computer every weekend."},{"w":"from overseas","p":"adv.","d":"overseas · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從海外","s":"The new teacher comes from overseas, and she loves to tell us stories about her home city in America."},{"w":"overseas（海外；不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"overseas · P 易混淆","c":"overseas 副詞不加介係詞","s":"Many young people in Taiwan want to go overseas to study or work, but they often miss their families."},{"w":"Perhaps not.","p":"adv.","d":"perhaps · A 延伸義／程度","c":"或許不會。","s":"Will our teacher give us homework on the last day of school? Perhaps not, but you should bring your books anyway."},{"w":"Perhaps you're right.","p":"adv.","d":"perhaps · A 延伸義／程度","c":"或許你是對的。","s":"Perhaps you're right, and we should take the MRT to the museum because the traffic is terrible on Saturdays."},{"w":"perhaps the best","p":"adv.","d":"perhaps · A 延伸義／程度","c":"也許是最好的","s":"The beef noodles at this little shop are perhaps the best in the whole city, so people wait in line for an hour."},{"w":"perhaps later","p":"adv.","d":"perhaps · A 延伸義／程度","c":"或許晚點","s":"I am too busy with my science project to play basketball right now, but perhaps later this afternoon I can."},{"w":"Perhaps it will rain.","p":"adv.","d":"perhaps · A 延伸義／程度","c":"也許會下雨。","s":"The sky is turning dark and the wind is blowing hard, so perhaps it will rain before the game ends."}]},{"unit":27,"theme":"pretty – quick","cards":[{"w":"pretty good","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當好","s":"The pizza at the new restaurant near our school is pretty good, and the prices are not too high for students."},{"w":"pretty much","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"差不多；幾乎","s":"I have pretty much finished my homework, so I just need to check my answers before I go to bed."},{"w":"pretty soon","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很快","s":"Summer vacation is coming pretty soon, so my friends and I are already making plans for a trip to the beach."},{"w":"pretty cold","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當冷","s":"It gets pretty cold in the mountains at night, so remember to pack a warm jacket and a hat for the trip."},{"w":"pretty well","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當好","s":"My little sister plays the violin pretty well for a nine-year-old, and she practices for an hour every day."},{"w":"pretty sure","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當確定","s":"I am pretty sure I left my umbrella on the bus this morning, so I will call the bus company after school."},{"w":"pretty late","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當晚","s":"We got home pretty late after the movie, so my mother was a little angry and asked where we had been."},{"w":"pretty bad","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當糟","s":"The weather was pretty bad on our trip to the beach, so we stayed in the hotel and played cards all day."},{"w":"pretty（漂亮的；形容詞）","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · P 易混淆","c":"pretty 形容詞指外表","s":"My aunt bought a pretty dress with small white flowers for the wedding, and everyone said she looked lovely."},{"w":"pretty（相當；副詞）","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · P 易混淆","c":"pretty 副詞指程度","s":"The math test was pretty hard, but I think I did well because I studied with my friends all week."},{"w":"a pretty girl","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · P 易混淆","c":"漂亮的女孩","s":"A pretty girl with long black hair sat next to me on the train, and we talked about our favorite books."},{"w":"pretty tired","p":"adv.","d":"pretty · P 易混淆","c":"相當累","s":"After swimming for two hours in the pool, the kids were pretty tired and fell asleep as soon as they got home."},{"w":"Probably not.","p":"adv.","d":"probably · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大概不會。","s":"Do you think our teacher will cancel the test because of the typhoon? Probably not, so keep studying tonight."},{"w":"most probably","p":"adv.","d":"probably · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很有可能","s":"This will most probably be the last warm weekend of the year, so let's have a barbecue by the river."},{"w":"He will probably come.","p":"adv.","d":"probably · A 延伸義／程度","c":"他大概會來。","s":"Tom said he was feeling better this morning, so he will probably come to the party tonight after all."},{"w":"probably the best","p":"adv.","d":"probably · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大概是最好的","s":"Our science teacher is probably the best teacher in the school, because she makes every lesson fun and interesting."},{"w":"probably because","p":"adv.","d":"probably · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大概是因為","s":"My little brother is crying in his room, probably because he lost the video game to his friend again."},{"w":"probably（很可能，約 70%）","p":"adv.","d":"probably · P 易混淆","c":"probably 可能性高","s":"Mary is probably at the library now, because she always goes there on Wednesday afternoons to study."},{"w":"probably 放助動詞後","p":"adv.","d":"probably · P 易混淆","c":"will probably + 動詞","s":"The store will probably close early tonight because of the typhoon, so let's buy some bread and water now."},{"w":"Be quick!","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快一點！","s":"Be quick! The train leaves in five minutes, and the next one does not come for another hour."},{"w":"quick, quick!","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快快！","s":"Quick, quick! The ice cream truck is at the corner, and it will drive away if we do not run now."},{"w":"come quick","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快來","s":"Come quick, everyone, because the baby birds in the nest outside the kitchen window are learning to fly."},{"w":"a quick look","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"匆匆一看","s":"I only had time for a quick look at the menu before the waiter came to take our order."},{"w":"a quick lunch","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快速吃午餐","s":"We had a quick lunch at the small store near the theater because the movie was starting in twenty minutes."},{"w":"a quick answer","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快速回答","s":"When the teacher asked who wanted to clean the board, Jimmy gave a quick answer and raised his hand."},{"w":"quick to learn","p":"adv.","d":"quick · A 延伸義／程度","c":"學得快","s":"My little cousin is quick to learn, so she already knows all the English letters at the age of four."},{"w":"quick（快的；口語副詞）","p":"adv.","d":"quick · P 易混淆","c":"quick 口語可當副詞","s":"Hurry up and get dressed quick, because Dad is waiting in the car and we are late for the wedding."},{"w":"Come quick!","p":"adv.","d":"quick · P 易混淆","c":"快來！","s":"Come quick! There is a rainbow over the mountain, and it will disappear in a few minutes."},{"w":"Run quickly!","p":"adv.","d":"quick · P 易混淆","c":"快跑！","s":"Run quickly to the bus stop, because the last bus is coming around the corner and it is a quick one."}]},{"unit":28,"theme":"quite – really","cards":[{"w":"quite a few","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不少","s":"Quite a few students in our class joined the art club this year because the new teacher is very popular."},{"w":"quite a lot","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當多","s":"My grandmother grows quite a lot of vegetables in her garden, so she gives some to all her neighbors."},{"w":"quite good","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當好","s":"The weather was quite good on Saturday, so we rode our bicycles along the river for the whole afternoon."},{"w":"not quite","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不完全","s":"The cake is not quite ready yet, so please wait ten more minutes before you cut it for the guests."},{"w":"quite right","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"完全正確","s":"You are quite right about the answer to question five, and I made a mistake when I checked it."},{"w":"quite a while","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當久","s":"We waited quite a while for the bus in the rain, and my shoes and socks were wet by the time it came."},{"w":"quite the same","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"完全一樣","s":"The two jackets look quite the same from far away, but mine has a small blue star on the pocket."},{"w":"quite sure","p":"adv.","d":"quite · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很確定","s":"I am quite sure that the library closes at nine on weekdays, but let's check the sign to be safe."},{"w":"quite（相當；偏正面）","p":"adv.","d":"quite · P 易混淆","c":"quite 口氣中性偏正面","s":"The new restaurant near the station is quite nice, and the waiters there are friendly and helpful."},{"w":"quite a + 名詞","p":"adv.","d":"quite · P 易混淆","c":"quite 放冠詞前","s":"It was quite a surprise when my parents gave me a puppy for my birthday last Sunday."},{"w":"quite a big house","p":"adv.","d":"quite · P 易混淆","c":"相當大的房子","s":"My uncle lives in quite a big house in the country, and there is a small pond with fish behind it."},{"w":"not quite（不完全）","p":"adv.","d":"quite · P 易混淆","c":"not quite 表略差一點","s":"My English is not quite as good as my sister's, but I am practicing every day and improving slowly."},{"w":"rather than","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"而不是","s":"I would like a glass of juice rather than a cup of tea, because tea does not let me sleep at night."},{"w":"would rather","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"寧願","s":"It is raining hard outside, so I would rather stay home and read a comic book than go to the mall."},{"w":"rather cold","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當冷","s":"It was rather cold in our room at school this morning, so most of the students did not take their jackets off."},{"w":"rather expensive","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當貴","s":"The shoes in that store are rather expensive, so let's look at the night market first before we buy."},{"w":"or rather","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更正確地說","s":"My brother is a good cook, or rather, he is good at making one thing, and that is fried rice."},{"w":"rather good","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當好","s":"The movie was rather good, but the ending was a little sad, so my sister cried in the theater."},{"w":"rather a lot","p":"adv.","d":"rather · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相當多","s":"My mother bought rather a lot of fruit at the market, so we will have apples and oranges for days."},{"w":"would rather + V","p":"adv.","d":"rather · C 句型","c":"寧願做…","s":"It is too hot to play outside, so I would rather swim in the pool with my cousins this afternoon."},{"w":"would rather stay home","p":"adv.","d":"rather · C 句型","c":"寧願待在家","s":"My father is tired after a long week, so he would rather stay home tonight than go to the restaurant."},{"w":"would rather…than…","p":"adv.","d":"rather · C 句型","c":"寧願…而不…","s":"On hot summer days, my grandmother would rather drink warm tea than eat ice cream, which surprises everyone."},{"w":"I'd rather walk than drive.","p":"adv.","d":"rather · C 句型","c":"我寧願走路而不開車。","s":"I'd rather walk to school than take the bus, because the bus is always crowded and the walk is short."},{"w":"rather than + V／N","p":"adv.","d":"rather · C 句型","c":"而不是…","s":"We decided to cook dinner at home rather than eat out, because the restaurants are full on holidays."},{"w":"tea rather than coffee","p":"adv.","d":"rather · C 句型","c":"要茶而不要咖啡","s":"My grandfather always drinks tea rather than coffee in the morning, because coffee makes his heart beat too fast."},{"w":"Really?","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"真的嗎？","s":"Really? You finished all of your homework before dinner, even the twenty math problems on page fifty?"},{"w":"not really","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不太是；不盡然","s":"I do not really like hot food, so I asked the waiter to make my noodles without any pepper."},{"w":"really good","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"真的很好","s":"The new bakery near our school is really good, and its egg cakes are always sold out before noon."},{"w":"I really mean it.","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我是認真的。","s":"I really mean it when I say you are my best friend, and I will always be there to help you."},{"w":"really want","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常想","s":"My little brother really wants a puppy for his birthday, so he has been very polite and helpful all month."},{"w":"Really!","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"真的！","s":"Really! I saw our English teacher singing on TV last night, and she has a beautiful voice."},{"w":"Not really.","p":"adv.","d":"really · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不太算。","s":"Do you like playing the piano? Not really, but my mother wants me to practice for an hour every day."},{"w":"really（真的；確實）","p":"adv.","d":"really · P 易混淆","c":"really 強調真實","s":"It is really cold in Taipei this week, so my mother asked me to wear a scarf and gloves to school."},{"w":"really nice","p":"adv.","d":"really · P 易混淆","c":"真的很好","s":"Our new neighbors are really nice, and they brought us a box of oranges from their farm on the first day."}]},{"unit":29,"theme":"right – seldom","cards":[{"w":"right here","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在這裡","s":"Put your bag right here next to my desk, and then we can start our homework together."},{"w":"right there","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在那裡","s":"Look, the bus stop is right there across the street, so we do not need to walk far."},{"w":"right after","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"緊接著","s":"Right after school ends, my brother and I usually go to the park to play basketball with friends."},{"w":"right before","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在…之前","s":"My mother always tells me to wash my hands right before dinner because it keeps me healthy."},{"w":"turn right","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"右轉","s":"Walk down this street for five minutes and then turn right, and you will see the post office."},{"w":"All right.","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好的。","s":"All right, I will help you with your math homework after I finish washing the dishes tonight."},{"w":"right in the middle","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"正中央","s":"The teacher put a big cake right in the middle of the table for the class party today."},{"w":"That's right.","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"對。","s":"That's right, the library closes at nine tonight, so we should return the books before dinner."},{"w":"right on time","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"準時","s":"The train arrived right on time, so Tom and his family did not miss their trip to Tainan."},{"w":"right behind you","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在你後面","s":"Do not worry about the big dog, because I am right behind you and it is very friendly."},{"w":"serve sb. right","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"罪有應得","s":"Tom did not study at all and failed the test, and his sister said it served him right."},{"w":"right, left and center","p":"adv.","d":"right · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到處","s":"After the big typhoon, broken trees were lying right, left and center all over our small town."},{"w":"right（右邊；正確；立刻）","p":"adv.","d":"right · P 易混淆","c":"right 多義","s":"Turn right at the corner, give the right answer in class, and come home right away after school."},{"w":"the right answer","p":"adv.","d":"right · P 易混淆","c":"正確答案","s":"Only three students got the right answer to the last math question, so the teacher explained it again."},{"w":"right-handed","p":"adv.","d":"right · P 易混淆","c":"右撇子的","s":"Most of the students in my class are right-handed, but my best friend writes and eats with her left hand."},{"w":"second to none","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"首屈一指","s":"My grandmother's beef noodles are second to none, and everyone in our family asks for more at dinner."},{"w":"on second thought","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再想一下","s":"I wanted to buy the blue jacket, but on second thought, the green one looks better on me."},{"w":"second-hand","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"二手的","s":"My father bought a second-hand bike for me, and it still works well after two years."},{"w":"every second day","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"每隔一天","s":"Our teacher gives us a short English test every second day, so we have to study at home."},{"w":"in a second","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"馬上","s":"Wait by the door and I will be back in a second, because I only need to get my keys."},{"w":"wait a second","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"等一下","s":"Wait a second, I think you took my umbrella by mistake because mine is also black."},{"w":"a second chance","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"第二次機會","s":"The coach gave Tom a second chance to join the team after he said sorry for being late."},{"w":"come second","p":"adv.","d":"second · A 延伸義／程度","c":"得第二名","s":"Mary ran very fast but came second in the race, and her parents were still very proud of her."},{"w":"second（第二；秒）","p":"adv.","d":"second · P 易混淆","c":"second 名詞指「秒」或形容詞「第二」","s":"Tom finished the race in second place, and he was only one second slower than the winner."},{"w":"the second floor","p":"adv.","d":"second · P 易混淆","c":"二樓","s":"The music room is on the second floor, so please take the stairs next to the school library."},{"w":"just a second","p":"adv.","d":"second · P 易混淆","c":"稍等一秒","s":"Just a second, please, I need to find my student card before I can borrow this book."},{"w":"secondly（第二點）","p":"adv.","d":"second · P 易混淆","c":"secondly 用於列舉","s":"First, we should clean the room, and secondly, we need to put the chairs back in the right places."},{"w":"seldom late","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很少遲到","s":"Our bus driver is seldom late, so we usually get to school ten minutes before class begins."},{"w":"seldom go out","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很少外出","s":"My grandfather and grandmother seldom go out at night because they like to watch TV and go to bed early."},{"w":"seldom seen","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很少見","s":"Snow is seldom seen in Taipei, so everyone was excited when it snowed on the mountain last winter."},{"w":"seldom, if ever","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · A 延伸義／程度","c":"幾乎從不","s":"My father seldom, if ever, eats fast food because he likes to cook healthy dinners at home."},{"w":"very seldom","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常少","s":"We very seldom see our cousins in Japan, so we were happy when they visited us last month."},{"w":"seldom 本身帶否定","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · C 句型","c":"seldom 不與 not 連用","s":"Mary seldom eats breakfast at home, so she often buys bread at the store near our school."},{"w":"He seldom reads, does he?","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · C 句型","c":"他很少看書，對吧？","s":"Your little brother seldom reads the books you give him, does he, even when they have many pictures?"},{"w":"seldom 附加問句用肯定","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · C 句型","c":"seldom 句尾用 does he","s":"Your parents seldom let you stay up late on school nights, do they, even for a good movie?"},{"w":"Seldom do I eat out.","p":"adv.","d":"seldom · C 句型","c":"我很少外食（倒裝）。","s":"Seldom do I eat out with my family on weekdays, because everyone comes home late from work and school."}]},{"unit":30,"theme":"since – sometimes","cards":[{"w":"since then","p":"adv.","d":"since · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從那時起","s":"Mary moved to Tainan three years ago, and since then we have only talked on the phone."},{"w":"long since","p":"adv.","d":"since · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很久以前就","s":"My grandfather has long since stopped riding his bike, but he still walks in the park every morning."},{"w":"since when?","p":"adv.","d":"since · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從何時起？","s":"Since when have you liked eating vegetables, because last year you would not even touch a carrot?"},{"w":"since childhood","p":"adv.","d":"since · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從小","s":"Tom and I have been good friends since childhood, and we still live on the same street."},{"w":"since + 過去時間點","p":"adv.","d":"since · C 句型","c":"since 接時間點","s":"I have not seen my cousin since last summer, so I am excited to visit her this weekend."},{"w":"since 2010","p":"adv.","d":"since · C 句型","c":"自2010年起","s":"My parents have run this small breakfast shop since 2010, and many students come here every morning."},{"w":"have lived here since 2010","p":"adv.","d":"since · C 句型","c":"從2010年住到現在","s":"We have lived here since 2010, so I know every shop and every park in this area."},{"w":"since（既然；因為）","p":"adv.","d":"since · C 句型","c":"since 當連接詞表原因","s":"Since it is raining so hard outside, let us stay home and watch a movie together tonight."},{"w":"so what?","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"那又怎樣？","s":"So what if I lost the game today, because I had fun and I can practice more tomorrow."},{"w":"and so on","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"等等","s":"For the school picnic tomorrow, we need to bring sandwiches, fruit, drinks, paper cups and so on."},{"w":"so-so","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"馬馬虎虎","s":"The movie was just so-so, so my friends and I left the theater a little unhappy."},{"w":"so far so good","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"目前為止還不錯","s":"I started learning to swim last week, and so far so good, because I can already swim a little."},{"w":"I think so.","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我想是的。","s":"When Mary asked if the store was open on Sunday, I said I think so, but we should call first."},{"w":"I hope so.","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"希望如此。","s":"My mother asked if I would pass the English test, and I said I hope so, because I studied hard."},{"w":"if so","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"如果是這樣","s":"Are you free on Saturday afternoon, and if so, would you like to go to the night market with me?"},{"w":"or so","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大約","s":"There were twenty or so students waiting outside the computer room before the class began this morning."},{"w":"so much for","p":"adv.","d":"so · A 延伸義／程度","c":"…到此為止；…沒指望了","s":"It is raining hard again, so much for our plan to go to the beach this weekend."},{"w":"so…that…","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"如此…以致於…","s":"The room was so hot that we opened all the windows and turned on two fans at once."},{"w":"so tired that I fell asleep","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"累到睡著了","s":"I was so tired after the basketball game that I fell asleep on the sofa before dinner."},{"w":"so + 形容詞／副詞","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"so 接形容詞或副詞","s":"The baby was so cute that everyone on the bus smiled and wanted to talk to her."},{"w":"so that","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"為了；以便","s":"I set my alarm clock for six so that I would not be late for the school trip."},{"w":"So am I.","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"我也是。","s":"Tom said he was hungry after the long hike, and I answered, So am I, let us find some food."},{"w":"So + 助動詞 + 主詞","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"「也是」倒裝","s":"My sister loves milk tea, and so do I, so we often go to the tea shop after school."},{"w":"so…as to","p":"adv.","d":"so · C 句型","c":"如此…以至於","s":"Would you be so kind as to open the window, because the room is too hot this afternoon?"},{"w":"sometimes late","p":"adv.","d":"sometimes · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有時遲到","s":"The school bus is sometimes late on rainy days, so I bring a book to read while I wait."},{"w":"sometimes rainy","p":"adv.","d":"sometimes · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有時下雨","s":"The weather in Taipei is sometimes rainy in spring, so you should keep an umbrella in your bag."},{"w":"Sometimes I walk.","p":"adv.","d":"sometimes · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有時我走路。","s":"Sometimes I walk to school with my neighbor, but on cold mornings my father drives us there."},{"w":"sometimes yes, sometimes no","p":"adv.","d":"sometimes · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有時是，有時不是","s":"When I ask my brother to share his snacks, the answer is sometimes yes, sometimes no, depending on his feelings."},{"w":"sometimes（有時候；一字）","p":"adv.","d":"sometimes · P 易混淆","c":"sometimes 是頻率副詞","s":"My uncle sometimes visits us on Sundays and brings fresh fruit from his farm in the mountains."}]},{"unit":31,"theme":"somewhere – straight","cards":[{"w":"somewhere around","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大約在","s":"The new bookstore opens somewhere around ten in the morning, so we can go there after breakfast."},{"w":"somewhere near here","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"這附近某處","s":"I dropped my wallet somewhere near here when I was running for the bus this morning."},{"w":"get somewhere","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有進展","s":"After practicing the piano for three months, I finally feel that I am getting somewhere with this song."},{"w":"somewhere to live","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"住的地方","s":"My cousin is looking for somewhere to live near her new school because the trip from home takes two hours."},{"w":"somewhere between","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在…之間某處","s":"The post office is somewhere between the bank and the park, but I forget which side of the street."},{"w":"somewhere in Taipei","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · P 易混淆","c":"台北某處","s":"My aunt lives somewhere in Taipei, but I have never visited her house because she moves often."},{"w":"Would you like to go somewhere?","p":"adv.","d":"somewhere · P 易混淆","c":"想去哪嗎（請求時可用）？","s":"Would you like to go somewhere quiet after school, because the library is too crowded to study today?"},{"w":"as soon as","p":"adv.","d":"soon · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一…就…","s":"Please call me as soon as you get home, because your mother is worried about the heavy rain."},{"w":"too soon","p":"adv.","d":"soon · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太快了","s":"The summer vacation ended too soon, and none of us felt ready to go back to school."},{"w":"how soon","p":"adv.","d":"soon · A 延伸義／程度","c":"多快（多久後）","s":"How soon can you finish your homework, because the movie starts at seven and we should leave early?"},{"w":"soon after","p":"adv.","d":"soon · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不久之後","s":"Soon after we arrived at the beach, dark clouds covered the sky and we had to go home."},{"w":"as soon as + 子句","p":"adv.","d":"soon · C 句型","c":"as soon as 當連接詞","s":"As soon as the rain stops, we will go out and play basketball on the school playground."},{"w":"As soon as I got home, it rained.","p":"adv.","d":"soon · C 句型","c":"我一到家就下雨了。","s":"As soon as I got home from the night market, it started to rain very hard outside."},{"w":"How soon will you arrive?","p":"adv.","d":"soon · C 句型","c":"你多久後會到？","s":"How soon will you arrive at the train station, because our train to Tainan leaves in twenty minutes?"},{"w":"soon（不久後）","p":"adv.","d":"soon · C 句型","c":"soon 從現在算起","s":"The weather is getting colder, so winter will be here soon and we need to buy warm coats."},{"w":"still here","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還在這裡","s":"It is already eight o'clock, but Mary is still here in the library finishing her science report."},{"w":"still alive","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還活著","s":"My great-grandmother is still alive at ninety-five, and she tells us stories about the old days."},{"w":"still waiting","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還在等","s":"We ordered our noodles twenty minutes ago, but we are still waiting because the restaurant is very busy."},{"w":"better still","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更好的是","s":"We could take the bus to the museum, or better still, we could ride our bicycles along the river."},{"w":"still more","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"更多","s":"The first test was hard, but the second one needed still more time and we were all tired."},{"w":"stand still","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"站著不動","s":"The teacher asked us to stand still for the class photo, but the little boy kept moving."},{"w":"sit still","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"坐好不動","s":"My little sister cannot sit still at the dinner table, so she often drops rice on the floor."},{"w":"keep still","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"保持不動","s":"The doctor told me to keep still while she looked at my sore throat with a small light."},{"w":"still water","p":"adv.","d":"still · A 延伸義／程度","c":"靜止的水","s":"Mosquitoes like to live near still water, so we should throw out the old water in the pots."},{"w":"still（仍然；持續）","p":"adv.","d":"still · P 易混淆","c":"still 表動作持續","s":"I am still studying for the test even though it is late, because I want to do well."},{"w":"He is still sleeping.","p":"adv.","d":"still · P 易混淆","c":"他還在睡。","s":"It is almost noon, but my brother is still sleeping because he stayed up late playing games."},{"w":"still 放否定詞前","p":"adv.","d":"still · P 易混淆","c":"still + not","s":"I still do not understand this math problem, so could you please explain it to me again?"},{"w":"go straight","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直走","s":"Go straight along this road for two minutes, and the hospital will be on your left side."},{"w":"straight home","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直接回家","s":"Tom goes straight home after basketball practice every day to take a shower before dinner with his family."},{"w":"straight to the point","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直接說重點","s":"Our teacher always gets straight to the point, so her lessons are short, clear and easy to follow."},{"w":"sit up straight","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"坐直","s":"My mother tells me to sit up straight when I do homework, or my back will hurt later."},{"w":"straight away","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"馬上","s":"When the teacher asks a question, Mary answers straight away because she always listens carefully in class."},{"w":"keep a straight face","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"板著臉不笑","s":"I could not keep a straight face when my dog walked into the room wearing my sister's hat."},{"w":"straight hair","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直髮","s":"Mary has long straight hair, and she washes it every evening before she goes to bed."},{"w":"think straight","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"頭腦清楚","s":"I was so tired after the long test that I could not think straight and gave the wrong bus number."},{"w":"for ten days straight","p":"adv.","d":"straight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"連續十天","s":"It rained for ten days straight last month, so we could not play baseball outside at all."},{"w":"straight（直直地；形容詞與副詞同形）","p":"adv.","d":"straight · P 易混淆","c":"straight 無 -ly 形式","s":"Please draw a straight line on the paper, and then walk straight to the door without turning."},{"w":"straightly（錯誤用法）","p":"adv.","d":"straight · P 易混淆","c":"沒有 straightly","s":"Tom said the man walked straightly down the road, but his teacher told him the right word is straight."},{"w":"Go straight for two blocks.","p":"adv.","d":"straight · P 易混淆","c":"直走兩個街區。","s":"Go straight for two blocks and turn left at the bank, and you will see the night market."}]},{"unit":32,"theme":"then – therefore","cards":[{"w":"by then","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到那時候","s":"The movie starts at seven, and by then we should have finished our dinner at the noodle shop."},{"w":"then and there","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"當場","s":"When Mary found a hungry puppy outside the school, she decided then and there to give it her lunch."},{"w":"and then","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"然後","s":"First we visited the temple, and then we had lunch at a small shop near the night market."},{"w":"but then","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不過話說回來","s":"The test was very hard, but then, I did not study much, so I cannot really complain."},{"w":"every now and then","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"時不時","s":"Every now and then my grandfather takes me fishing at the lake, and we talk about his school days."},{"w":"from then on","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從那時起","s":"Tom failed his first English test, and from then on he studied ten new words every single night."},{"w":"until then","p":"adv.","d":"then · A 延伸義／程度","c":"直到那時","s":"The school fair is next Friday, and until then every class is busy making games and gifts for the big day."},{"w":"If…, then…","p":"adv.","d":"then · C 句型","c":"如果…，那麼…","s":"If you finish all your homework before dinner, then you can watch TV with us for an hour."},{"w":"first…, then…","p":"adv.","d":"then · C 句型","c":"先…，然後…","s":"First, mix the eggs and milk in a bowl, then put them slowly into the hot pan."},{"w":"If it rains, then we stay home.","p":"adv.","d":"then · C 句型","c":"如果下雨，那我們就待在家。","s":"If it rains tomorrow morning, then we stay home and play board games instead of going to the zoo."},{"w":"then（那時；然後）","p":"adv.","d":"then · C 句型","c":"then 不能連接兩句","s":"We lived in a small town then, and life was quieter than it is in the city now."},{"w":"and then（然後）","p":"adv.","d":"then · C 句型","c":"用 and then 連接","s":"I finished my homework, and then I helped my mother cook a big dinner in the kitchen."},{"w":"there and back","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"來回","s":"The trip to my grandmother's house takes two hours there and back, so we usually leave early in the morning."},{"w":"out there","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在外面；在那裡","s":"It is very cold out there tonight, so put on your heavy coat before you walk the dog."},{"w":"get there","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到達那裡","s":"If we take the MRT, we will get there in twenty minutes, but the bus takes almost an hour."},{"w":"There you are.","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在這呢；給你。","s":"There you are, I have been looking for you everywhere since lunch because the teacher wants to see you."},{"w":"There you go.","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就是這樣；給你。","s":"There you go, this is the last piece of cake, and now everyone at the party has had some."},{"w":"There, there.","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好了好了（安慰）。","s":"There, there, do not cry anymore, because we can buy another ice cream after we wash your hands."},{"w":"up there","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在上面那裡","s":"Can you see the bird up there on the top of the tall tree next to the school gate?"},{"w":"be there for sb.","p":"adv.","d":"there · A 延伸義／程度","c":"支持某人","s":"My best friend was there for me when I was sick in the hospital, and she visited me every day."},{"w":"there（那裡；副詞，不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"there · P 易混淆","c":"go there 不加 to","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live in Tainan, and we go there every summer vacation to eat the famous local food."},{"w":"There is／are（有）","p":"adv.","d":"there · P 易混淆","c":"there be 句型","s":"There are three new students in our class this year, and there is also a new English teacher."},{"w":"There are many people there.","p":"adv.","d":"there · P 易混淆","c":"那裡有很多人。","s":"There are many people there at the night market every Saturday, so hold my hand and stay close."},{"w":"Therefore, we left.","p":"adv.","d":"therefore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"因此，我們離開了。","s":"The food at that restaurant was cold and the waiter was rude. Therefore, we left without eating dessert."},{"w":"and therefore","p":"adv.","d":"therefore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"因此","s":"Tom forgot to set his alarm and therefore missed the first bus to school this morning, so he was late."},{"w":"therefore 常放句首","p":"adv.","d":"therefore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"Therefore, + 子句","s":"Mary practiced the piano every day for a whole year. Therefore, she played beautifully at the school music show last Friday."},{"w":"It rained; therefore, we stayed.","p":"adv.","d":"therefore · A 延伸義／程度","c":"下雨了；因此我們留下。","s":"It rained all day on Sunday; therefore, we stayed home and watched two old movies with our parents."},{"w":"therefore（因此；副詞）","p":"adv.","d":"therefore · P 易混淆","c":"therefore 不可直接連接兩句","s":"The bridge was closed for repairs; therefore, drivers had to use the long road around the lake."},{"w":"It rained. Therefore, we stayed.","p":"adv.","d":"therefore · P 易混淆","c":"下雨了。因此我們留下。","s":"It rained hard all weekend. Therefore, we stayed inside and finished our science projects early."}]},{"unit":33,"theme":"through – together","cards":[{"w":"go through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"經歷；通過","s":"Mary is going through a difficult time because her best friend moved to Japan last month."},{"w":"get through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"撐過；打通電話","s":"I tried to call my mother three times, but I could not get through because her phone was busy."},{"w":"look through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"瀏覽","s":"Before the test, I like to look through my notes quickly to make sure I remember the important points."},{"w":"read through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"讀完","s":"Please read through the whole story once before you answer the questions on the next page."},{"w":"see through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"看穿","s":"My mother can always see through my excuses when I say I am too sick to go to school."},{"w":"all the way through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從頭到尾","s":"The movie was so exciting that we watched it all the way through without going to the bathroom."},{"w":"through and through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"徹頭徹尾","s":"My grandfather is a farmer through and through, and he still gets up at five to water his vegetables."},{"w":"be through with","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"結束；不再來往","s":"After he lied to her twice, Mary said she was through with Tom and would not talk to him again."},{"w":"put sb. through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"（電話）轉接","s":"When I called the hospital, the woman asked me to wait and then put me through to the doctor."},{"w":"Monday through Friday","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"週一到週五","s":"The school library is open from eight to five, Monday through Friday, but it is closed on weekends."},{"w":"break through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"突破","s":"Our team hopes to break through this year and win our first game against the school across the river."},{"w":"walk through","p":"adv.","d":"through · A 延伸義／程度","c":"走過；逐步說明","s":"The teacher walked through the steps of the math problem with us before we tried the others ourselves."},{"w":"through（穿過；從內部）","p":"adv.","d":"through · P 易混淆","c":"through 指從中穿過","s":"The river goes through the middle of the city, and many people walk along it in the evening."},{"w":"walk through the forest","p":"adv.","d":"through · P 易混淆","c":"穿過森林","s":"We walked through the forest for an hour and found a small river with very clear water."},{"w":"from today","p":"adv.","d":"today · A 延伸義／程度","c":"從今天起","s":"From today, I will get up at six every morning and run in the park before school."},{"w":"today of all days","p":"adv.","d":"today · A 延伸義／程度","c":"偏偏今天","s":"I forgot my umbrella today of all days, when the rain is heavier than it has been all month."},{"w":"a week from today","p":"adv.","d":"today · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一週後的今天","s":"A week from today we will be sitting on the beach in Japan, so let us start packing now."},{"w":"young people today","p":"adv.","d":"today · A 延伸義／程度","c":"現在的年輕人","s":"Young people today spend many hours on the phone, so my grandmother worries we do not talk enough."},{"w":"Today is my day.","p":"adv.","d":"today · A 延伸義／程度","c":"今天是我的日子。","s":"Today is my day, because my painting is on the school wall and we are having my favorite dinner tonight."},{"w":"today（今天；不加 on／in）","p":"adv.","d":"today · P 易混淆","c":"today 前不加介係詞","s":"We do not have any homework today, so my friends and I are going to the movies after school."},{"w":"get together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"聚在一起","s":"My cousins and I get together at our grandmother's house every Chinese New Year to eat and play games."},{"w":"put together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"組合；拼湊","s":"It took my brother and me three hours to put together the new desk from the furniture store."},{"w":"all together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"全部一起","s":"The teacher asked us to read the poem all together, so the whole class spoke in one loud voice."},{"w":"together with","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"連同","s":"Mary mailed the birthday card together with a box of cookies to her grandmother in Tainan last week."},{"w":"go together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"相配；一起去","s":"This white shirt and blue skirt go together very well, so I will wear them to the party."},{"w":"come together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"聚集；順利進行","s":"Everyone in our class comes together to clean the beach every summer, and we always have fun."},{"w":"work together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"合作","s":"When we work together on the school project, we finish faster and learn from each other's ideas."},{"w":"stick together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"團結","s":"Our teacher told us to stick together at the museum so that nobody would get lost in the big building."},{"w":"bring together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"使團聚","s":"The school sports day brings together students, parents and teachers for a happy day of games and food."},{"w":"live together","p":"adv.","d":"together · A 延伸義／程度","c":"同住","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live together with us in a big old house, so dinner time is always noisy and fun."},{"w":"together（一起）","p":"adv.","d":"together · P 易混淆","c":"together 一字","s":"My sister and I always walk to school together because we like to talk about our day on the way."},{"w":"get together（聚會）","p":"adv.","d":"together · P 易混淆","c":"get together 動詞片語","s":"Every Chinese New Year, all my cousins get together at my grandmother's house and play cards until midnight."},{"w":"a get-together（聚會）","p":"adv.","d":"together · P 易混淆","c":"名詞加連字號","s":"Our class is going to have a small get-together at a pizza restaurant to celebrate the end of the school year."}]},{"unit":34,"theme":"tonight – under","cards":[{"w":"See you tonight.","p":"adv.","d":"tonight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"今晚見。","s":"The basketball game starts at seven, so bring your ticket and I will see you tonight at the gym."},{"w":"late tonight","p":"adv.","d":"tonight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"今晚稍晚","s":"Dad has a lot of work at the office, so he will come home very late tonight and eat dinner alone."},{"w":"What's on tonight?","p":"adv.","d":"tonight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"今晚有什麼節目？","s":"Mom turned on the TV after dinner and asked us, what's on tonight, is there a good movie to watch?"},{"w":"not tonight","p":"adv.","d":"tonight · A 延伸義／程度","c":"今晚不行","s":"I want to play computer games with my brother, but Mom says not tonight because we have a test tomorrow."},{"w":"tonight（今晚；不加 on）","p":"adv.","d":"tonight · P 易混淆","c":"tonight 前不加介係詞","s":"My uncle is going to take us to the night market tonight, so we do not need to cook dinner at home."},{"w":"too many","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太多（可數）","s":"There were too many people at the night market last Saturday, so we could not find a place to sit."},{"w":"too bad","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太可惜了","s":"It's too bad that you were sick on the day of the school trip, because the zoo was really fun."},{"w":"me too","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我也是","s":"When Lisa said she loved the new chicken burger at the school store, Peter smiled and said, me too."},{"w":"too late","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太遲了","s":"We ran to the station as fast as we could, but it was too late and the last train had already left."},{"w":"all too soon","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太快了（可惜）","s":"The summer vacation ended all too soon, and we had to go back to school before we were ready."},{"w":"too good to be true","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"好到不像真的","s":"The store said we could get a free phone with every drink, but that sounded too good to be true."},{"w":"none too","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一點也不","s":"Our math teacher was none too happy when half the class forgot to bring their homework again this morning."},{"w":"too little, too late","p":"adv.","d":"too · A 延伸義／程度","c":"太少也太遲","s":"He started studying the night before the big exam, but it was too little, too late, and he failed."},{"w":"too…to V","p":"adv.","d":"too · C 句型","c":"太…而不能…","s":"The soup was too hot to eat right away, so we waited for a few minutes and talked about school."},{"w":"too young to drive","p":"adv.","d":"too · C 句型","c":"太小不能開車","s":"My brother is only fifteen, so he is too young to drive and has to ride his bike to school."},{"w":"too tired to walk","p":"adv.","d":"too · C 句型","c":"累到走不動","s":"After the long walk up the mountain, the little girl was too tired to walk, so her father carried her."},{"w":"too + 形容詞 + for sb. to V","p":"adv.","d":"too · C 句型","c":"對某人來說太…","s":"The water in the river was too cold for the children to swim in, so they played on the sand instead."},{"w":"too hard for me to do","p":"adv.","d":"too · C 句型","c":"對我來說太難做","s":"This science homework is too hard for me to do alone, so I am going to ask my sister for help."},{"w":"too（也；句尾）","p":"adv.","d":"too · C 句型","c":"too 置於肯定句尾","s":"Jenny likes to play basketball after school, and her good friend Amy enjoys playing the game very much too."},{"w":"twice a week","p":"adv.","d":"twice · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一週兩次","s":"I go to the pool to swim twice a week, on Tuesday and Friday, because I want to be a strong swimmer."},{"w":"twice as big","p":"adv.","d":"twice · A 延伸義／程度","c":"兩倍大","s":"Our new music room is twice as big as the old one, so there is a lot of room for group work."},{"w":"think twice","p":"adv.","d":"twice · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再三考慮","s":"You should think twice before you spend all your money on that game, because you may need it later."},{"w":"twice as much","p":"adv.","d":"twice · A 延伸義／程度","c":"兩倍多","s":"My brother eats twice as much as I do at dinner, but he is still thinner than me."},{"w":"twice the size","p":"adv.","d":"twice · A 延伸義／程度","c":"兩倍大小","s":"The new mall is twice the size of the old one, and it has a movie theater on the top floor."},{"w":"twice a day","p":"adv.","d":"twice · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一天兩次","s":"The doctor told me to take this medicine twice a day, once after breakfast and once after dinner."},{"w":"twice（兩次）","p":"adv.","d":"twice · P 易混淆","c":"twice 代替 two times","s":"I have been to Japan twice with my family, and both times we visited the famous temples in Kyoto."},{"w":"twice as…as","p":"adv.","d":"twice · P 易混淆","c":"…的兩倍","s":"Tom runs twice as fast as his younger brother, so he always wins when they race in the park."},{"w":"under the weather","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"身體不舒服","s":"Kevin felt a little under the weather this morning, so his mother let him stay home and rest in bed."},{"w":"under control","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"控制住","s":"The fire in the kitchen was soon under control because my father quickly put a wet towel over the pan."},{"w":"under pressure","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"壓力下","s":"Many students feel under pressure before the big exam, so our teacher told us to get enough sleep."},{"w":"under the sea","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"海底","s":"The movie showed colorful fish and a big old ship deep under the sea, and the children loved it."},{"w":"under one's nose","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在眼前","s":"I looked for my glasses for ten minutes, but they were right under my nose on the kitchen table."},{"w":"children under 12","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"十二歲以下兒童","s":"Children under 12 can enter the zoo for free on Sunday, so my parents are taking my little cousins there."},{"w":"under way","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"進行中","s":"The school sports day was already under way when we arrived, and the first race was just finishing."},{"w":"go under","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"沉下；倒閉","s":"The small bookstore near our school went under last year because most people buy their books on the Internet now."},{"w":"under repair","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"維修中","s":"The bridge near my house is under repair this month, so we have to take a longer way to school."},{"w":"under the table","p":"adv.","d":"under · A 延伸義／程度","c":"私下；暗中","s":"The man paid the worker under the table so that nobody would know how much money he really made."},{"w":"under（在…下面；接觸或正下方）","p":"adv.","d":"under · P 易混淆","c":"under 指正下方","s":"The cat likes to sleep under the chair in the living room because it is cool and quiet there."},{"w":"under the bed","p":"adv.","d":"under · P 易混淆","c":"在床底下","s":"My little brother put his report card under the bed because he did not want Mom to see his grades."}]},{"unit":35,"theme":"up","cards":[{"w":"get up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"起床","s":"I get up at six every morning so that I can eat a good breakfast before I catch the school bus."},{"w":"wake up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"醒來","s":"The loud noise from the street woke me up at five this morning, and I could not fall asleep again."},{"w":"grow up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"長大","s":"When I grow up, I want to be a doctor like my aunt and help sick children in small towns."},{"w":"give up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"放棄","s":"The math problem was really hard, but Amy did not give up and finally found the answer by herself."},{"w":"stay up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"熬夜","s":"Don't stay up late playing games tonight, because we have to leave for the train station at six tomorrow."},{"w":"hurry up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"快一點","s":"Hurry up and put on your shoes, or we will miss the bus and be late for school again."},{"w":"look up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"查閱；仰望","s":"If you don't know the meaning of a word, you can look it up in the dictionary on your phone."},{"w":"pick up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"撿起；接送；學會","s":"Mom will pick me up at the school gate after my basketball practice because it will be dark by then."},{"w":"make up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"編造；和好；化妝","s":"Tom and Jerry had a big fight over a game last week, but they made up and are good friends again."},{"w":"cheer up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"振作","s":"Lisa was sad about her test, so her friends bought her ice cream to cheer her up after school."},{"w":"clean up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"打掃乾淨","s":"After the birthday party, we all helped to clean up the living room and wash the dirty dishes."},{"w":"show up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"出現","s":"We waited for Mark at the movie theater for thirty minutes, but he never showed up or called us."},{"w":"turn up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"出現；調大","s":"Grandpa can't hear the news very well, so he always asks me to turn up the TV for him."},{"w":"bring up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"養育；提出","s":"My grandmother brought up five children by herself, and she still cooks dinner for the whole family every Sunday."},{"w":"catch up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"趕上","s":"I was sick for a week, so now I have to study hard to catch up with the rest of the class."},{"w":"keep up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"跟上；保持","s":"The teacher talked so fast that many students could not keep up and asked her to say it again."},{"w":"put up with","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"忍受","s":"I can't put up with the loud music from the next room when I am trying to do my homework."},{"w":"use up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"用完","s":"We used up all the eggs making breakfast this morning, so I need to buy some more at the store."},{"w":"end up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最後成為","s":"We planned to go hiking on Sunday, but it rained all day, so we ended up watching movies at home."},{"w":"speak up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大聲說","s":"Please speak up a little, because the students in the back of the room cannot hear your answer."},{"w":"sign up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"報名","s":"More than forty students signed up for the school basketball team this year, so the coach has to choose carefully."},{"w":"dress up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"打扮","s":"On Halloween, my little sister likes to dress up as a cat and go around the streets near us asking for candy."},{"w":"eat up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"吃光","s":"Eat up your vegetables, and then you can have a piece of chocolate cake for dessert, said Mom."},{"w":"sit up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"坐直；熬夜","s":"Sit up straight when you write, or your back will start to hurt after a long day at school."},{"w":"be up to","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"由…決定；忙於","s":"It is up to you whether we have pizza or noodles for dinner, because I like both of them."},{"w":"What's up?","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"怎麼了？","s":"When I saw my friend crying in the hall, I walked over and asked her, what's up, are you all right?"},{"w":"up to date","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最新的","s":"My cousin always keeps his phone up to date, so he always has the newest games to show us."},{"w":"time is up","p":"adv.","d":"up · A 延伸義／程度","c":"時間到","s":"Time is up, please put down your pencils and pass your test papers to the front of the room."}]},{"unit":36,"theme":"upside down – well (1)","cards":[{"w":"turn upside down","p":"adv.","d":"upside down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"翻倒；弄得亂七八糟","s":"The strong wind turned the small boats upside down on the lake, and the fishermen had to swim back."},{"w":"hang upside down","p":"adv.","d":"upside down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"倒掛","s":"At the zoo, we saw many bats hang upside down from the roof of their dark little house during the day."},{"w":"hold the map upside down","p":"adv.","d":"upside down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"地圖拿反了","s":"We got lost in Tainan because my brother held the map upside down the whole time and nobody noticed."},{"w":"the picture is upside down","p":"adv.","d":"upside down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"圖片倒了","s":"Look, the picture on the wall is upside down, so the man in it looks like he is standing on his head."},{"w":"turn the room upside down","p":"adv.","d":"upside down · A 延伸義／程度","c":"把房間翻得亂七八糟","s":"My brother turned the whole room upside down looking for his keys, and then he found them in his pocket."},{"w":"run upstairs","p":"adv.","d":"upstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"跑上樓","s":"When the phone rang, Mary ran upstairs as fast as she could to answer it in her bedroom."},{"w":"the people upstairs","p":"adv.","d":"upstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"樓上的人","s":"The people upstairs play loud music every night, so my father went up to talk to them politely."},{"w":"upstairs bedroom","p":"adv.","d":"upstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"樓上的臥室","s":"My sister moved into the upstairs bedroom last month because she wanted a quiet place to study for her exams."},{"w":"wait upstairs","p":"adv.","d":"upstairs · A 延伸義／程度","c":"在樓上等","s":"You can wait upstairs in my room and play with my cat while I finish washing the dishes."},{"w":"go upstairs（不加 to）","p":"adv.","d":"upstairs · P 易混淆","c":"upstairs 前不加介係詞","s":"After dinner, I usually go upstairs to do my homework, and my parents stay downstairs to watch TV."},{"w":"usually late","p":"adv.","d":"usually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"通常遲到","s":"Jack is usually late for school because he likes to stay in bed until the very last minute."},{"w":"I usually walk.","p":"adv.","d":"usually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"我通常走路。","s":"I usually walk to school with my neighbor Ben, but when it rains heavily, my father drives us."},{"w":"not usually","p":"adv.","d":"usually · A 延伸義／程度","c":"通常不會","s":"My parents do not usually let me drink soda, but they said yes at my birthday party last week."},{"w":"usually（通常）","p":"adv.","d":"usually · P 易混淆","c":"usually 頻率約 80%","s":"My mother usually cooks dinner at home, and we only eat out on special days like my birthday."},{"w":"usually 放一般動詞前","p":"adv.","d":"usually · P 易混淆","c":"usually + 動詞","s":"My father usually takes the bus to work, but today he drove because he had to carry some boxes."},{"w":"very well","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很好；好吧","s":"Jenny speaks Japanese very well because she lived in Tokyo with her family for three years as a child."},{"w":"the very best","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最好的","s":"My grandmother makes the very best dumplings in our town, and people line up to buy them every morning."},{"w":"the very first","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"最先的","s":"I still remember the very first day at this school when I did not know anyone in my class."},{"w":"the very same","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"一模一樣的","s":"Amy and I were surprised when we showed up at school wearing the very same blue sweater on the same day."},{"w":"at the very end","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"就在最後","s":"The movie was long and boring, but at the very end there was a big surprise that made everyone laugh."},{"w":"not very","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不太","s":"The new restaurant near the park is not very good, because the food was cold and the service was slow."},{"w":"the very idea","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"光是這想法","s":"The very idea of eating snails for dinner made my little sister cover her mouth and run from the table."},{"w":"Thank you very much.","p":"adv.","d":"very · A 延伸義／程度","c":"非常感謝。","s":"Thank you very much for helping me carry these heavy books to the library on such a hot day."},{"w":"very + 原級形容詞","p":"adv.","d":"very · C 句型","c":"very 只加原級","s":"This box is very heavy, so please ask your brother to help you carry it into the house."},{"w":"very tall","p":"adv.","d":"very · C 句型","c":"很高","s":"My cousin is very tall for a twelve-year-old, so people often think he is already in high school."},{"w":"very 不加比較級","p":"adv.","d":"very · C 句型","c":"不能說 very taller","s":"You can say Jack is very tall or much taller than Tom, but you cannot say he is very taller."},{"w":"the very + 名詞","p":"adv.","d":"very · C 句型","c":"the very 強調「正是」","s":"This is the very book I have been looking for since last month, so I am going to buy it now."},{"w":"well done","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"做得好；全熟","s":"Well done, class, everyone passed the spelling test, so there will be no homework this weekend."},{"w":"get well soon","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"早日康復","s":"Everyone in my class made a big card for our sick teacher and wrote get well soon on it in many colors."},{"w":"well known","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"著名的","s":"Tainan is well known for its delicious street food, so many visitors come to the city every weekend."},{"w":"well off","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"富有的","s":"Peter's family is quite well off, so they travel abroad twice a year and live in a big house."},{"w":"may as well","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"不妨","s":"It is raining too hard to play outside, so we may as well stay in and finish our science project."},{"w":"Well, …","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"嗯，…","s":"Well, I am not sure about the answer, but I think the train leaves at nine in the morning."},{"w":"do well","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"表現好","s":"Sandy did well on her math test because she studied with her father every night for two weeks."},{"w":"well-behaved","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"乖巧的","s":"The children were so well-behaved at the restaurant that the waiter gave each of them a free cookie."},{"w":"sleep well","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"睡得好","s":"I did not sleep well last night because the dog next door barked for hours, so I feel tired now."},{"w":"well worth","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"很值得","s":"The night market is a little far from our hotel, but the delicious food there is well worth the long walk."},{"w":"feel well","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"身體好","s":"Grandma did not feel well after lunch, so we took her to see the doctor in the afternoon."},{"w":"well paid","p":"adv.","d":"well · A 延伸義／程度","c":"薪水高","s":"My uncle is well paid at his new job in the computer company, so he bought a new car last month."},{"w":"well（好地；副詞）","p":"adv.","d":"well · P 易混淆","c":"well 修飾動詞","s":"Linda sings very well, so the music teacher asked her to sing alone at the school show next Friday."}]},{"unit":37,"theme":"well (2) – yesterday","cards":[{"w":"speak English well","p":"adv.","d":"well · P 易混淆","c":"英文說得好","s":"My cousin speaks English well because she watches American movies every night and talks with her teacher from Canada."},{"w":"feel well（身體好）","p":"adv.","d":"well · P 易混淆","c":"well 當形容詞指健康","s":"Ben did not feel well this morning, so he stayed home from school and slept until noon."},{"w":"well（井）","p":"adv.","d":"well · P 易混淆","c":"well 名詞是「井」","s":"In the old village, people had no water pipes, so they got water from a deep well near the temple."},{"w":"wide awake","p":"adv.","d":"wide · A 延伸義／程度","c":"完全清醒","s":"It was already midnight, but I was still wide awake because I drank two cups of coffee after dinner."},{"w":"wide open","p":"adv.","d":"wide · A 延伸義／程度","c":"大開","s":"Someone left the front door wide open last night, and this morning we found a cat sleeping on the sofa."},{"w":"far and wide","p":"adv.","d":"wide · A 延伸義／程度","c":"四處；到處","s":"People came from far and wide to see the beautiful lanterns at the festival in our small town."},{"w":"open your mouth wide","p":"adv.","d":"wide · A 延伸義／程度","c":"嘴巴張大","s":"The dentist asked me to open my mouth wide so that he could look at my back teeth carefully."},{"w":"wide of the mark","p":"adv.","d":"wide · A 延伸義／程度","c":"差得遠","s":"My guess about the number of candies in the bottle was wide of the mark, because there were more than two hundred."},{"w":"eyes wide open","p":"adv.","d":"wide · A 延伸義／程度","c":"眼睛睜大","s":"The children sat with their eyes wide open as the man pulled a white rabbit out of his black hat."},{"w":"wide（寬寬地；具體）","p":"adv.","d":"wide · P 易混淆","c":"wide 副詞指張開程度","s":"The little boy opened his arms wide to hug his father when he came home from his long trip."},{"w":"widely（廣泛地）","p":"adv.","d":"wide · P 易混淆","c":"widely 指範圍廣","s":"This kind of rice is widely grown in the south of Taiwan, and the farms there are green and wide."},{"w":"widely used","p":"adv.","d":"wide · P 易混淆","c":"廣泛使用","s":"The phone is widely used by students today, but our school does not let us use it in class."},{"w":"widely known","p":"adv.","d":"wide · P 易混淆","c":"廣為人知","s":"It is widely known that eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth, but many children still love candy."},{"w":"go wrong","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"出錯","s":"Everything went wrong on the day of our school trip, because the bus broke down and it rained all afternoon."},{"w":"get it wrong","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"弄錯；誤會","s":"I thought the test was on Friday, but I got it wrong, and it was actually on Thursday morning."},{"w":"What's wrong?","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"怎麼了？","s":"You look very tired and sad today, what's wrong, did you have a fight with your good friend?"},{"w":"wrong number","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"打錯電話","s":"I called my aunt to say happy birthday, but a strange man answered, so I knew I had the wrong number."},{"w":"the wrong way","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"錯誤的方式；相反方向","s":"We walked the wrong way for twenty minutes before we noticed that the museum was behind us."},{"w":"take sth. the wrong way","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"誤解","s":"Please don't take my words the wrong way, I only meant that your new haircut looks different, not bad."},{"w":"in the wrong","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"有錯的一方","s":"After the two boys fought, the teacher found out that both of them were in the wrong and said sorry."},{"w":"Don't get me wrong.","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"別誤會我。","s":"Don't get me wrong, I love your cooking, but I am too full to eat another piece of cake."},{"w":"wrong side","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"錯的一邊","s":"My grandmother got on the train on the wrong side of the station and ended up in Taichung instead of Taipei."},{"w":"Nothing wrong with that.","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · A 延伸義／程度","c":"那沒什麼不對。","s":"Some students like to study alone in the library instead of in groups, and there is nothing wrong with that."},{"w":"wrong（錯誤地；口語副詞）","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · P 易混淆","c":"wrong 口語可當副詞","s":"You did the math problem wrong because you forgot to carry the one, so please try it again."},{"w":"wrongly（錯誤地；正式）","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · P 易混淆","c":"wrongly 多放動詞前","s":"The police wrongly believed the young man took the bike, but a video later showed they were wrong."},{"w":"You spelled it wrong.","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · P 易混淆","c":"你拼錯了。","s":"My sister wrote the word Wednesday on the board, but the teacher said she spelled it wrong and showed her."},{"w":"He was wrongly blamed.","p":"adv.","d":"wrong · P 易混淆","c":"他被錯怪了。","s":"Jack was wrongly blamed for breaking the window, but the teacher found out it was the wind that did it."},{"w":"yesterday morning","p":"adv.","d":"yesterday · A 延伸義／程度","c":"昨天早上","s":"Yesterday morning I missed the school bus because I could not find my sports shoes anywhere in the house."},{"w":"the day before yesterday","p":"adv.","d":"yesterday · A 延伸義／程度","c":"前天","s":"We had a surprise test the day before yesterday, and I was lucky because I had studied the night before."},{"w":"It seems like yesterday.","p":"adv.","d":"yesterday · A 延伸義／程度","c":"彷彿是昨天。","s":"It seems like yesterday that we first came to this school, but now we are already in our third year."},{"w":"yesterday（昨天；不加 on）","p":"adv.","d":"yesterday · P 易混淆","c":"yesterday 前不加介係詞","s":"My family went to the beach yesterday, and we played in the water until the sun went down."},{"w":"yesterday evening","p":"adv.","d":"yesterday · P 易混淆","c":"昨天傍晚","s":"My aunt came to visit us yesterday evening, and she brought a big box of mangoes from her farm."}]},{"unit":38,"theme":"yet","cards":[{"w":"not yet","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還沒","s":"Have you finished your science homework, asked Mom, and I said not yet, but I only have two questions left."},{"w":"as yet","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"至今","s":"We have not as yet decided where to go for our family trip, but my sister wants to visit Japan."},{"w":"yet another","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"又一個","s":"It was yet another rainy day in Taipei, so we could not have our sports class outside again."},{"w":"and yet","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"然而","s":"Tom studied for only one hour, and yet he got the highest score in the class on the math test."},{"w":"yet again","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"再一次","s":"My little brother lost his water bottle yet again, so Mom wrote his name on the new one in big letters."},{"w":"the best yet","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"到目前最好的","s":"This is the best yet of all the cakes you have made, so you should sell them at the school fair."},{"w":"Have you finished yet?","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"你做完了嗎？","s":"Have you finished your lunch yet, because the bus to the museum is leaving in only five minutes?"},{"w":"Not just yet.","p":"adv.","d":"yet · A 延伸義／程度","c":"還不行；還沒。","s":"Can we open the birthday presents now, asked my sister, but Dad smiled and said not just yet."},{"w":"yet（尚未；否定句、問句句尾）","p":"adv.","d":"yet · P 易混淆","c":"yet 放否定句與問句尾","s":"I have not seen the new movie about the dog yet, so please don't tell me how it ends."},{"w":"yet（然而；連接詞）","p":"adv.","d":"yet · P 易混淆","c":"yet 可當連接詞同 but","s":"The old man is poor, yet he gives food to the street cats near his house every single day."},{"w":"It's small yet strong.","p":"adv.","d":"yet · P 易混淆","c":"它小卻強壯。","s":"My new phone is small yet strong, because I dropped it on the floor twice and it did not break."},{"w":"I haven't seen it yet.","p":"adv.","d":"yet · P 易混淆","c":"我還沒看過。","s":"Everyone says the new comic book is great, but I haven't seen it yet because the library copy is always out."}]}];
